[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A\u001b[K\r\n  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mScope of What You're Tracking\u001b[m: At a high level, which of these pillars are \u001b[1min scope for V1\u001b[m versus \u001b[1mout of\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[1mscope\u001b[m?\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mParts & Quantities\u001b[m: What components you own and how many you have on hand.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mStorage Locations\u001b[m: Where each part physically lives (e.g., cabinet, drawer, grid bin, anti-static bag).\r\n  3. \u001b[1mProjects / BOMs (Bills of Materials)\u001b[m: Allocating or reserving parts for specific electronics projects you're\r\n  building.\r\n  4. \u001b[1mSupplier & Ordering / Low-Stock Alerts\u001b[m: Tracking distributor part numbers (DigiKey, Mouser, LCSC), prices,\r\n  datasheets, and reorder thresholds.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Keep \u001b[1m1 (Parts & Quantities)\u001b[m and \u001b[1m2 (Storage Locations)\u001b[m as the core of V1, include lightweight \u001b[1m4 (Supplier info /\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mdatasheets)\u001b[m if helpful, and defer \u001b[1m3 (Projects / BOM allocation)\u001b[m as out of scope for V1. (Or tell me which mix you\r\n  want in V1!)\r\n\n\u001b[90m─────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> sgtm\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mPart Entry & Identification\u001b[m: When adding parts to your inventory or finding them at the workbench, do you\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  want V1 to rely strictly on \u001b[1mmanual entry & text search/filtering\u001b[m, or do you also want \u001b[1mcamera-based features\u001b[m (such\r\n  as scanning DigiKey/Mouser/LCSC supplier bag barcodes/2D DataMatrix codes, scanning QR labels on your storage bins,\r\n  or snapping photos of components)?\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Keep V1 focused on fast \u001b[1mmanual entry, text search, and category/attribute filtering\u001b[m (optionally attaching a part\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\r\n  photo), and rule barcode/DataMatrix scanning and distributor API auto-lookup out of scope for V1. (Or let me know\r\n  if barcode scanning is a must-have for V1!)\r\n\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────"]
