[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K  ➡️ Keep \u001b[1m1 (Parts & Quantities)\u001b[m and \u001b[1m2 (Storage Locations)\u001b[m as the core of V1, include lightweight \u001b[1m4 (Supplier info /\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mdatasheets)\u001b[m if helpful, and defer \u001b[1m3 (Projects / BOM allocation)\u001b[m as out of scope for V1. (Or tell me which mix you\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  want in V1!)\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> sgtm\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mPart Entry & Identification\u001b[m: When adding parts to your inventory or finding them at the workbench, do you\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  want V1 to rely strictly on \u001b[1mmanual entry & text search/filtering\u001b[m, or do you also want \u001b[1mcamera-based features\u001b[m (such\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  as scanning DigiKey/Mouser/LCSC supplier bag barcodes/2D DataMatrix codes, scanning QR labels on your storage bins,\r\n  or snapping photos of components)?\u001b[K\r"]
[0.000, "o", "\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Keep V1 focused on fast \u001b[1mmanual entry, text search, and category/attribute filtering\u001b[m (optionally attaching a part\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  photo), and rule barcode/DataMatrix scanning and distributor API auto-lookup out of scope for V1. (Or let me know\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  if barcode scanning is a must-have for V1!)\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Manual entry is fine. LCSC codes are useful\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ4\u001b[m - \u001b[1mLCSC Part Number (\u001b[94;22mCxxxxxx\u001b[39;1m) Role\u001b[m: When you enter an LCSC code (e.g., \u001b[94mC12345\u001b[m), do you want the app to \u001b[1mmerely\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mstore and index it\u001b[m as a field/link (so you can search by it or tap to open the LCSC product page / datasheet), or\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  would you like us to \u001b[1minvestigate fetching part metadata automatically from LCSC\u001b[m (name, categ"]
