[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Question\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m                                                                                                               \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mWhen a user enters an LCSC part code (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Cx\u001b[5b`\u001b[39m, e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`C14663`\u001b[39m), what are the viable ways for an iOS Flutter\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mapp to fetch part metadata (name, manufacturer part number, category, package/footprint, key electrical\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mparameters, datasheet URL, product page URL) without requiring a custom backend proxy?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mSpecifically:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. What is LCSC's official API story (authentication, approval requirements, rate limits, suitabilit"]
[0.000, "o", "y for a\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mclient-side personal app)?\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m2. Does LCSC (or EasyEDA / JLCPCB component library, which shares \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Cxxxxxx`\u001b[39m codes) expose an unauthenticated   \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mJSON endpoint that is commonly used by open-source electronics tools (e.g., KiCad plugins, Part-DB, Inventree,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39measyeda2kicad) to look up \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Cx\u001b[5b`\u001b[39m part metadata and datasheets?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m3. What exact payload/fields are returned by any viable endpoint, and what are the reliability/rate-limit/ToS\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mcaveats?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff"]
