[2.946, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[31A\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ4\u001b[m - \u001b[1mLCSC Part Number (\u001b[94;22mCxxxxxx\u001b[39;1m) Role\u001b[m: When you enter an LCSC code (e.g., \u001b[94mC12345\u001b[m), do you want the app to \u001b[1mmerely\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mstore and index it\u001b[m as a field/link (so you can search by it or tap to open the LCSC product page / datasheet), or\r\n  would you like us to \u001b[1minvestigate fetching part metadata automatically from LCSC\u001b[m (name, category, package/footprint,\r\n  specs, datasheet URL) when you type an LCSC code?\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Create a \u001b[1mResearch\u001b[m ticket on the map to check if LCSC has an unauthenticated/public endpoint or scrape-free API\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  we can query from iOS to auto-fill part details from a \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m code, with manual entry + deep-linking to the LCSC\u001b[K\r\n  webpage as the fallback.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> resea"]
[0.000, "o", "rch ticket\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ5\u001b[m - \u001b[1miOS UI Style & Backup/Import\u001b[m: Last breadth check before I create the Wayfinder map and kick off the LCSC\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\r\n  research subagent:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. Should the UI design feel \u001b[1miOS-native (Cupertino)\u001b[m, \u001b[1mMaterial 3\u001b[m, or do you want a \u001b[1mPrototype\u001b[m ticket on the map so we\u001b[K\r\n  can explore the core UI flow and aesthetic interactively before locking the spec?\u001b[K\r\n  2. Should V1 include \u001b[1mexporting/importing the on-device JSON file\u001b[m via the iOS Share Sheet / Files app (so you can\u001b[K\r\n  back up your inventory or edit/seed it from your Mac)?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Yes to both: include a UI \u001b[1mPrototype\u001b[m ticket on the map to nail the workbench browsing/entry experience, and\u001b[?7h\u001b[112G\r\n  include \u001b[1miOS Files / Share Sheet JSON export & import\u001b[m in V1 scope.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 6 files \u001b[37m(GLOSSARY.md, 01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md, 02-part-domain-model-and-specs.md, +3)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEditing\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[3"]
