[0.000, "o", "m+  \u001b[39mType: grilling\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mStatus: open\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Question                                                                                                    \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mHow should **Storage Locations** be structured and addressed so they match your actual physical workbench setup\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m(e.g., Akro-Mils drawer cabinets, SMD sample books/binders, assortment boxes with grid cells, anti-static bags\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39min totes)?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mKey decisions to resolve:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. **Hierarchy model**: Flat labels (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`"]
[0.000, "o", "\"Cabinet A - R3C4\"`\u001b[39m), fixed 2-level (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Container → Slot`\u001b[39m), or\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m     \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39marbitrary nesting (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Room/Shelf → Cabinet → Drawer → Compartment`\u001b[39m)?                                             \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m2. **Grid / coordinate addressing**: Do you want first-class support for grid coordinates (e.g., rows \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`A–F`\u001b[39m ×\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mcolumns \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`1–8`\u001b[39m, or numbered binder pages/strips) for visual bin-finding, or simple named locations?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m3. **Location lifecycle**: Moving parts between locations, viewing everything inside a container/drawer, and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mhandling unlocated (\"loose / to-be-sorted\") parts.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, de"]
