[0.000, "o", "ked by: 02, 03\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Question                                                                                                    \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mHow should the iOS app look and feel at the workbench for its core loops?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mKey flows to prototype and validate interactively:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. **Fast lookup & filtering**: Finding a part by value/name/package/LCSC code (\"Do I have a 4.7k 0603\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mresistor, and which drawer/slot is it in?\").\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m2. **Quick stock adjustment**: Incrementing/decrementing quantity (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`-1`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`+10"]
[0.000, "o", "`\u001b[39m, custom delta) right from the\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m     \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39msearch result or part detail view without friction.                                                            \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m3. **Part entry**: Adding a new part (including typing an LCSC \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Cx\u001b[5b`\u001b[39m code and assigning a Storage\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mLocation).\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m15 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m4. **Storage browser**: Browsing by physical container/drawer to see what's inside.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m16 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m5. **Visual style**: iOS Cupertino vs. customized Material 3 / high-density workbench theme.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[21X\u001b[?2026l"]
[1.566, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[31A\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ4\u001b[m - \u001b[1mLCSC Part Number (\u001b[94;22mCxxxxxx\u001b[39;1m) Role\u001b[m: When you enter an LCSC code (e.g., \u001b[94mC12345\u001b[m), do you want the app to \u001b[1mmerely\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mstore and index it\u001b[m as a field/link (so you can search by it or tap to open the LCSC product page / datasheet), or\r\n  would you like us to \u001b[1minvestigate fetching part metadata automatically from LCSC\u001b[m (name, category, package/footprint,\r\n  specs, datasheet URL) when you type an LCSC code?\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ Create a \u001b[1mResearch\u001b[m ticket on the map to check if LCSC has an unauthenticated/public endpoint or scrape-free API\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  we can query from iOS to auto-fill part details from a \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m code, with manual entry + deep-linking to the LCSC\u001b[K\r\n  webpage as the fallback.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> resea"]
