[0.000, "o", "to any depth (e.g., \u001b[94mShelf 1 → Cabinet\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mA → Drawer 3 → Sub-compartment B\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption C — Flat labels\u001b[m: Just a single text string or tag per location (e.g., \u001b[94m\"Cabinet A - Drawer 12\"\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A — Fixed two-level (\u001b[94;22mContainer\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mSlot\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m, where every part is placed in a \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m and optionally a\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  specific \u001b[1mS\u001b[?7h\u001b[13G\u001b[m\n\n\n\n\u001b[10D\u001b[?2026l"]
