[0.000, "o", " the lab where parts are kept (e.g., a drawer cabinet, binder page, grid\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39mbox, or individual bin/slot).\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m3 \u001b[39;48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m-  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Warehouse, bin (when referring to the general concept rather than a specific container type), place\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m1 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Container**:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m2 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mA top-level physical storage unit at the workbench (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"SMD Binder #1\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"IC Drawer Cabinet\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Passives\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123mGrid Box A\"`\u001b[39m).                                                                                                  \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m3 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Warehouse, building, parent location\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Slot**:"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mAn addressable compartment, drawer, cell, or strip inside a **Container** (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Drawer R2C3\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Cell B4\"`\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Page 4, Strip 2\"`\u001b[39m). A **Part** is stored in a **Container** and optionally in a specific **Slot** within that\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mcontainer.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Sub-location, child location, bin (when referring to the top-level container)\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[68X\u001b[68C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium · 1 subagent(s)\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
