[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[26A\u001b[K\r\n  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mHierarchy Depth\u001b[m: How are your physical parts containers organized at your workbench, and how should the app\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  model them?\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOption A — Fixed two-level (\u001b[94;22mContainer\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mSlot\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: You define top-level \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m\"SMD Binder #1\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"IC Drawer\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mCabinet\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"Passives Grid Box A\"\u001b[m) and inside them \u001b[1mSlots\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m\"Page 4, Strip 2\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"Drawer R2C3\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"Cell B4\"\u001b[m). Fast to\r\n  pick in two taps without deep tree navigation.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B — Arbitrary tree hierarchy\u001b[m: A location can have a parent location to any depth (e.g., \u001b[94mShelf 1 → Cabinet\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mA → Drawer 3 → Sub-compartment B\u001b[m).\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption C — Flat labels\u001b[m: Just a single text string or tag per location (e.g., \u001b[94m\"Cabinet A - Drawer 12\"\u001b[m).\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A — Fixed two-level (\u001b[94;22mContainer\u001b[39;1m → \u001b[94;22mSlot\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m, where every part is p"]
[0.000, "o", "laced in a \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m and optionally a\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\r\n  specific \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m within that container (since some containers like a project tote or ziplock box might not have sub-\r\n  slots).\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Option A\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(GLOSSARY.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  I've updated \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke237714d0dd119f2;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 to replace the generic term with \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m and \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mContainer Layout & Slot Addressing\u001b[m: When you create a \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m, how should its \u001b[1mSlots\u001b[m be defined and\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\r\n  displayed?\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOpt\u001b[m\r\n⣾  \u001b[90mEditing files...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: In request-review mode, file edits are shown for approval before being"]
