[0.000, "o", " • \u001b[1mOption A — Structured Grid Generator + Freeform Slots\u001b[m: When creating a Container, you can pick either:\r\n\u001b[6C1. \u001b[1mGrid Container\u001b[m (specify Rows × Columns, e.g., \u001b[94m4 × 6\u001b[m or \u001b[94mA–D × 1–6\u001b[m), which automatically generates addressable\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mSlots\u001b[m (\u001b[94mA1\u001b[m..\u001b[94mD6\u001b[m) and lets the UI render a visual 2D grid map highlighting which slot holds your part, or\r\n\u001b[6C2. \u001b[1mFreeform / List Container\u001b[m, where Slots are just named labels created on the fly (e.g., \u001b[94m\"Page 1\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"Bag 3\"\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m\"Top Shelf\"\u001b[m\r\n\n\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[94mself\u001b[m needs approval for \u001b[33;1mBash\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m\n\b\u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[33m●\u001b[m "]
