[0.000, "o", ";151;198;123m`\"Passives\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123mGrid Box A\"`\u001b[39m).                                                                                                  \u001b[?7h\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m2 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mA top-level physical storage unit at the workbench (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"SMD Binder #1\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"IC Drawer Cabinet\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Passives\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123mGrid Box A\"`\u001b[39m), tracked as a first-class entity with a name and optional description.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m3 \u001b[m    _Avoid_: Warehouse, building, parent location\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m4 \u001b[?7h\u001b[5G\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m5 \u001b[m    **Slot**:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m6 \u001b[39;48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m-  \u001b[39mAn addressable compartment, drawer, cell, or strip inside a **Container** (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Drawer R2C3\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Cell B4\"`\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Page 4"]
[0.000, "o", ", Strip 2\"`\u001b[39m). A **Part** is stored in a **Container** and optionally in a specific **Slot** within that\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39mcontainer.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mA named compartment, drawer, cell, or strip inside a **Container** (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"A1\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Drawer 12\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"Page 4\"`\u001b[39m),\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mrepresented as a string label created on the fly. A **Slot** holds at most one **Part** (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`(Container, Slot)`\u001b[39m is\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mstrictly 1-to-1 when a Slot is specified).\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m7 \u001b[m    _Avoid_: Sub-location, child location, bin (when referring to the top-level container)\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend "]
