[5.206, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[4A  2. What if a Part is placed in a \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m \u001b[3mwithout\u001b[m specifying a \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m (or has \u001b[1mno Container at all\u001b[m because it just\u001b[K\r\n  arrived in the mail)—are multiple unassigned/slotless parts allowed, with the 1-to-1 uniqueness enforced\u001b[K\r\n  specifically when a \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m is named (\u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m pair is unique)?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[0 q\u001b[J\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes\u001b[m: \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m is strictly unique (1 Part per Slot; the picker shows which slots are already taken and\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  warns/prevents double-assigning), while Parts without a Slot (either unassigned to any Container, or placed in a\r\n  Container with no Slot specified) don't conflict with each other.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ5\u001b[m - \u001b[1mContainer Lifecycle (First-Class Entity vs. String Tag)\u001b[m: Should"]
[0.000, "o", " a \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m be a managed entity in the JSON\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\r\n  store (with an \u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and optional \u001b[94mdescription\u001b[m, so you can rename \u001b[94m\"Drawer Cabinet 1\"\u001b[m in one place and browse\r\n  empty containers), while a \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m is a simple string label (e.g., \u001b[94m\"A1\"\u001b[m) on the Part within that Container?\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes\u001b[m: \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m are first-class entities (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, optional \u001b[94mdescription\u001b[m) so they can be listed, created, or\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\r\n  renamed cleanly, whereas a \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m is a lightweight string label on the Part (unique per \u001b[94m(containerId, slot)\u001b[m when \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m\r\n  is non-null).\r\n\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(map.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(GLOSSARY.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEditing\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(03-storage-location-hierarchy.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[94mself\u001b[m needs approval for \u001b[33;1mBash\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[33m┃\u001b[m \u001b[90m────────────────"]
