[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[15A\u001b[35C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke25849c3f1acc59d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5583ec31272d19f9;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/research/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u000701-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\u001b[13C\u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=jkf28b5c1cb7c4cef5;https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cxxxxxx\u0007https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cx\u001b[5b\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[26D\u001b[94mEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEnForSea\u001b[m\r\n\n\n\n\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27A• \u001b[1mFixed 2-level hierarchy\u001b[m: \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m (managed entity with \u001b[94mid\u001b[m, \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, optional \u001b[94mdescription\u001b[m) → \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m (on-the-fly string\r\n  label on the Part).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mStrict 1-Part-per-Slot\u001b[m: \u001b[94m(containerId, slot)\u001b[m is unique when \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m is specified; unassigned (\u001b[94mcontainerId: null\u001b[m) and\r\n  bulk-container (\u001b[94mslot: null\u001b[m) parts are also supported.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  The background research subagent is currently finishing \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1a388ddc700189dc;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, which will unblock\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk199d793188d155c7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/02-part-domain-model-and-specs.md\u0007Part domain model, categories, and electrical specifications\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007. I'll let you know as soon as the research subagent\u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n  reports back!\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(map.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  The research subagent has finished \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka0cece86f635d640;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (full report at\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2f0c8dccc45ea124;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/research/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u000701-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007):\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOfficial LCSC OpenAPI\u001b[m (\u001b[94mips.lcsc.com\u001b[m) is B2B-only and requires static IP whitelisting, so it won't work from an\r\n  iPhone.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mUnauthenticated LCSC Detail Endpoint\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGET \u001b]8;id=jkf44917e63011b4fa;https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cxxxxxx\u0007https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cx\u001b[5b\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a\r\n  standard browser \u001b[94mUser-Agent"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m) works directly without auth or cookies. It returns:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94mproductCode\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"C14663\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m (MPN, \u001b[94m\"CC0603KRX7R9BB104\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"YAGEO\"\u001b[m)\r\n\tDescription (\u001b[94mproductDescEn ?? productIntroEn ?? productNameEn\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\tCategory hierarchy (\u001b[94mparentCatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Capacitors\"\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Ceramic Capacitors\"\u001b[m)\r\n\tPackage/footprint (\u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"0603\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"LQFN-56(7x7)\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\tStructured electrical parameters (\u001b[94mparamVOList[]\u001b[m with \u001b[94mparamNameEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEnForSearch\u001b[m)\r\n\tDi\u001b[K\n\n\b\b\u001b[90mn\u001b[94mg\u001b[m\n\n\u001b[8D\u001b[?2026l"]
