[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27AThe background research subagent is currently finishing \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1a388ddc700189dc;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, which will unblock\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk199d793188d155c7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/02-part-domain-model-and-specs.md\u0007Part domain model, categories, and electrical specifications\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007. I'll let you know as soon as the research subagent\u001b[K\r\n  reports back!\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(map.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  The research subagent has finished \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9f48c7c1f955ffbe;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (full report at\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk51722d3bbbf538"]
[0.000, "o", "ea;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/research/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u000701-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007):\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOfficial LCSC OpenAPI\u001b[m (\u001b[94mips.lcsc.com\u001b[m) is B2B-only and requires static IP whitelisting, so it won't work from an\r\n  iPhone.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mUnauthenticated LCSC Detail Endpoint\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGET \u001b]8;id=jk923e108d6c46d6c8;https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cxxxxxx\u0007https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cx\u001b[5b\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a\r\n  standard browser \u001b[94mUser-Agent\u001b[m) works directly without auth or cookies. It returns:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94mproductCode\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"C14663\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m (MPN, \u001b[94m\"CC0603KRX7R9BB104\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"YAGEO\"\u001b[m)\r\n\tDescription (\u001b[94mproductDescEn ?? productIntroEn ?? productNameEn\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\tCategory hierarchy (\u001b[94mparentCatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Capacitors\"\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Ceramic Capacitors\"\u001b[m)"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\tPackage/footprint (\u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"0603\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"LQFN-56(7x7)\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\tStructured electrical parameters (\u001b[94mparamVOList[]\u001b[m with \u001b[94mparamNameEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEnForSearch\u001b[m)\r\n\tDirect datasheet PDF URL (\u001b[94mpdfUrl\u001b[m) and product page URL (\u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=jk7ae051d47e426a89;https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/\u0007https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/\u001b]8;;\u0007{productCode}.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mhtml\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  With both \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9f48cbc1f956068a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and [Physical storage location hierarchy and\r\n  addressing](file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-\r\n  v1/issues\u001b[K\n\n\n\u001b[9D\u001b[?2026l"]
