[12.246, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOfficial LCSC OpenAPI\u001b[m (\u001b[94mips.lcsc.com\u001b[m) is B2B-only and requires static IP whitelisting, so it won't work from an\r\n  iPhone.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mUnauthenticated LCSC Detail Endpoint\u001b[m (\u001b[94mGET \u001b]8;id=jkc09584fe96523b36;https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cxxxxxx\u0007https://wmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail?productCode=Cx\u001b[5b\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with a\r\n  standard browser \u001b[94mUser-Agent\u001b[m) works directly without auth or cookies. It returns:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94mproductCode\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"C14663\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m (MPN, \u001b[94m\"CC0603KRX7R9BB104\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"YAGEO\"\u001b[m)\n\u001b[88D• Description (\u001b[94mproductDescEn ?? productIntroEn ?? productNameEn\u001b[m)\r\n      • Category hierarchy (\u001b[94mparentCatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Capacitors\"\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Ceramic Capacitors\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n      • Package/footprint (\u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"0603\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"LQFN-56(7x7)\"\u001b[m)\r\n      • Structured electrical parameters (\u001b[94mparamVOList"]
