[0.000, "o", "wser \u001b[94mUser-Agent\u001b[m) works directly without auth or cookies. It returns:\r\n\t\u001b[94mproductCode\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"C14663\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m (MPN, \u001b[94m\"CC0603KRX7R9BB104\"\u001b[m), \u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m (\u001b[94m\"YAGEO\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\tDescription (\u001b[94mproductDescEn ?? productIntroEn ?? productNameEn\u001b[m\r\n\tCategory hierarchy (\u001b[94mparentCatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Capacitors\"\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"Ceramic Capacitors\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\r\n\tPackage/footprint (\u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m, e.g. \u001b[94m\"0603\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"LQFN-56(7x7)\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\n\u001b[64D• Structured electrical parameters (\u001b[94mparamVOList[]\u001b[m with \u001b[94mparamNameEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparamValueEnForSearch\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6C• Direct datasheet PDF URL (\u001b[94mpdfUrl\u001b[m) and product page URL (\u001b[94m\u001b]8;id=jk622d3b7c69bfb2cb;https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/\u0007https://www.lcsc.com/product-detail/\u001b]8;;\u0007{productCode}.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mhtml\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  With both \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3fd7d94abe96c10;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts"]
