[0.051, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mCategories & electrical specifications (\u001b[94;22mcategory\u001b[39;1m and \u001b[94;22mspecs\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: As documented in\u001b[?7h\u001b[88G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk183846acd847406;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u0007LCSC part metadata lookup from C-code\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, LCSC provides a category (\u001b[94mparentCatalogName\u001b[m / \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, e.g.,\u001b[?7h\u001b[106G\r\n  \u001b[94m\"Capacitors\"\u001b[m / \u001b[94m\"Ceramic Capacitors\"\u001b[m) and a list of parameter key-value pairs (\u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m, e.g., \u001b[94mCapacitance:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[3C\u001b[94m100nF\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94mVoltage Rated: \"50V\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTolerance: \"±10%\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94mTemperature Coefficient: \"X7R\"\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  How should categories and electrical specs be modeled on a \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m?\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption A (Flexible key-value specs + string category)\u001b[m: Store \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m as an optional string (auto-filled from\r\n  LCSC's \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, with quick-pick suggesti"]
[0.000, "o", "ons from categories already in your catalog) and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m as an ordered\r\n  \u001b[94mMap<String, String>\u001b[m of parameter names to values (auto-populated from LCSC's \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m with \u001b[94m\"-\"\u001b[m placeholders\u001b[K\r\n  stripped, and freely editable as key-value rows in the UI).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (Fixed per-category schemas)\u001b[m: Define rigid types (Resistor, Capacitor, IC, etc.) with dedicated typed\r\n  fields per category.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes to Option A — store \u001b[94;22mcategory\u001b[39;1m as a string and \u001b[94;22mspecs\u001b[39;1m as an ordered \u001b[94;22mMap<String, String>\u001b[39;1m populated from LCSC's\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[39;1m and editable as key-value pairs.\u001b[?7h\u001b[47G\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> option A\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 11s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mLCSC auto-fill mapping"]
