[0.100, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[19A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes to Option A — store \u001b[94;22mcategory\u001b[39;1m as a string and \u001b[94;22mspecs\u001b[39;1m as an ordered \u001b[94;22mMap<String, String>\u001b[39;1m populated from LCSC's\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mLCSC auto-fill mapping, manual overrides, and duplicate \u001b[94;22mCxxxxxx\u001b[39;1m handling\u001b[m: When you enter a \u001b[94mCxxxxxx\u001b[m code in\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⣟  \u001b[90mThe LCSC lookup maps specific fields from the LCSC data to the part data: LCSC code to normalized code\u001b[94m, des\u001b[90mcri\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.066, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AHow should categories and electrical specs be modeled on a \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m?\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption A (Flexible key-value specs + string category)\u001b[m: Store \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m as an optional string (auto-filled from\r\n  LCSC's \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, with quick-pick suggestions from categories already in your catalog) and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m as an ordered\r\n  \u001b[94mMap<String, String>\u001b[m of parameter names to values (auto-populated from LCSC's \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m with \u001b[94m\"-\"\u001b[m placeholders\u001b[K\r\n  stripped, and freely editable as key-value rows in the UI).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (Fixed per-category schemas)\u001b[m: Define rigid types (Resistor, Capacitor, IC, etc.) with dedicated typed\r\n  fields per category.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes to Option A — store \u001b[94;22mcategory\u001b[39;1m as a string and \u001b[94;22mspecs\u001b[39;1m as an ordered \u001b[94;22mMap<String, String>\u001b[39;1m populated from LCSC's\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[39;1m and editable as key-value pairs.\u001b[?7h\u001b[47G\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m───────"]
[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> option A\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 11s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mLCSC auto-fill mapping, manual overrides, and duplicate \u001b[94;22mCxxxxxx\u001b[39;1m handling\u001b[m: When you enter a \u001b[94mCxxxxxx\u001b[m code in\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  the Add/Edit Part form and tap \"Fetch from LCSC\", here is the proposed mapping from the LCSC detail payload:\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mname\u001b[m ← \u001b[94mproductDescEn\u001b[m (falling back to \u001b[94mproductIntroEn\u001b[m or \u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m)\n\u001b[69D\u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m ← \u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[17D\u001b[94manufacturer\u001b[m ← \u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m\n\u001b[26D\u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m ← \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m\"Ceramic Capacitors\"\u001b[m)\n\u001b[51D\u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m ← \u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m (e.g., \u001b[94m\"0603\"\u001b[m)\u001b[K\n\u001b[38D\u001b[94mdatasheetUrl\u001b[m ← \u001b[94mpdfUrl\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[21D\u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m ← \u001b[94m{ paramNameE\u001b[m\n\u001b[80C\u001b[94me, de\u001b[90ms\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026"]
