[0.000, "o", ";52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mpackage/footprint, optional LCSC code (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Cx\u001b[5b`\u001b[39m), and electrical **Specs**.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m3 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Item, product, SKU, device\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Spec**:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mA named electrical or physical attribute of a **Part** (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Capacitance: 100nF`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Voltage Rated: 50V`\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m    \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Tolerance: ±10%`\u001b[39m), represented as an ordered key-value pair on the Part.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m_Avoid_: Parameter, property, custom field, tag\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1mshift+tab\u001b[90;22m to auto-approve file edits\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1mAccept this file edit?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, accept this change\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, reject this change\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend ·"]
