[4.816, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001b[30A\u001b[35D\u001b[1K \u001b[94m<= lowStockThreshold\u001b[m flags low stock), \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mCategories & Electrical Specifications\u001b[m:\n\u001b[38D• \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m is an optional string (auto-filled from LCSC's \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, with quick-pick suggestions from\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K categories already in the catalog).\u001b[K\n\u001b[36D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m is an ordered key-value map (\u001b[94mMap<String, String>\u001b[m) of parameter names to values (e.g., \u001b[94m{\"Capacitance\":\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94m\"100nF\", \"Voltage Rated\": \"50V\"}\u001b[m), auto-populated from LCSC's \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m and freely editable as key-value rows\r\n\u001b[6Cin the UI.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mLCSC Auto-Fill & Duplicate Handling\u001b[m:\n\u001b[36D\u001b[1K • Fetching a \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m code pre-fills \u001b[94mname\u001b[m (\u001b[94mproductDescEn ?? productIntroEn ?? productModel\u001b[m), \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m (\u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m (\u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m), \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m (\u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m), \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m (\u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m), \u001b[94mdatasheetUrl\u001b[m (\u001b[94mpdfUrl\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K (\u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m excluding \u001b[94m\"-\"\u001b[m placeholders) into the form as normal editable local fields.\n\u001b[88D\u001b[1K • Entering a duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m warns with a quick link to the existing \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m (to easily update its stock),\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K without hard-blocking if a second catalog entry is intentional.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mStock & Location Cardinality\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[29D\u001b[1K • Each \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m has a single \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m and lives in at most one \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m location (\u001b[94mcontainerId?\u001b[m, \u001b[94mslot?\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  Does this capture our shared understanding so I can resolve\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka98deebd1d400daa;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/02-part-domain-model-and-specs.md\u0007Part domain model, categories, and electrical specifications\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and update the map?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────"]
