[0.000, "o", " \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Question\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mWith a **Part** storing \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`name`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`lcscCode`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`mpn`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`manufacturer`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`category`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`package`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`notes`\u001b[39m, and an\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mordered \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`specs`\u001b[39m map (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Map<String, String>`\u001b[39m), how should workbench search and filtering behave?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mKey decisions to resolve:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. **Search matching & engineering unit equivalence**: Should searching for values like \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4k7`\u001b[39m / \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`4.7k`\u001b[39m /\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;1"]
[0.000, "o", "51;198;123m`4700R`\u001b[39m or \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`100nF`\u001b[39m / \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`0.1uF`\u001b[39m / \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`104`\u001b[39m normalize engineering units and SI prefixes so equivalent values match\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39macross \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`name`\u001b[39m and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`specs`\u001b[39m, or rely on case-insensitive token/substring matching?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m13 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m2. **Searchable fields & ranking**: Which fields are indexed/searched by the main search bar (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`name`\u001b[39m,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`lcscCode`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`mpn`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`manufacturer`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`category`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`package`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`specs`\u001b[39m values, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`slot`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`notes`\u001b[39m), and how should\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mmulti-token queries (e.g., \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"100nF 0603 X7R\"`\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[39m) work?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m14 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m3. **Filter facets**: Which quick filters should be available alongside text search (e.g., Category, Container,\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mPackage, Low Stock, Unassigned)?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[6.051, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[31A\u001b[6C\u001b[94m<= lowStockThreshold\u001b[m flags low stock), \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mCategories & Electrical Specifications\u001b[m:\n\u001b[39D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m is an optional string (auto-filled from LCSC's \u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m, with quick-pick suggestions from\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Ccategories already in the catalog).\n\u001b[36D\u001b[1K • \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m is an ordered key-value map (\u001b[94mMap<String, String>\u001b[m) of parameter names to values (e.g., \u001b[94m{\"Capacitance\":\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94m\"100nF\", \"Voltage Rated\": \"50V\"}\u001b[m), auto-populated from LCSC's \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m and freely editable as key-value rows\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K in the UI.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mLCSC Auto-Fill & Duplicate Handling\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[36D\u001b[1K • Fetching a \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m code pre-fills \u001b[94mname\u001b[m (\u001b[94mproductDescEn ?? productIntroEn ?? productModel\u001b[m), \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m (\u001b[94mproductModel\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m (\u001b[94mbrandNameEn\u001b[m), \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m (\u001b[94mcatalogName\u001b[m), \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m (\u001b[94mencapStandard\u001b[m), \u001b[94mdatasheetUrl\u001b[m (\u001b[94mpdfUrl\u001b[m),"]
[0.000, "o", " and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K (\u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m excluding \u001b[94m\"-\"\u001b[m placeholders) into the form as normal editable local fields.\u001b[K\n\u001b[88D\u001b[1K • Entering a duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m warns with a quick link to the existing \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m (to easily update its stock),\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K without hard-blocking if a second catalog entry is intentional.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mStock & Location Cardinality\u001b[m:\u001b[K\n\u001b[29D\u001b[1K • Each \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m has a single \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m and lives in at most one \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m location (\u001b[94mcontainerId?\u001b[m, \u001b[94mslot?\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  Does this capture our shared understanding so I can resolve\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka98deebd1d400daa;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/02-part-domain-model-and-specs.md\u0007Part domain model, categories, and electrical specifications\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and update the map?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────"]
