[0.033, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 4m 18s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial analysis indicates no issues were detected within the library code. Considering the n...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 3 files \u001b[37m(AGENTS.md, SKILL.md, SKILL.md)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ls -la && ls -la .agents/)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m… 19 more actions (11 reads, 3 edits, 5 commands) …\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(main.dart)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(dart analyze)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 10s\u001b[m\r\n\n  I have claimed the next frontier ticket on the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf59c99fb8176f423;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/map.md\u0007Electronics Parts Tracker V1 Map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n  **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd7d82bddf270c2f5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/04-workbench-ui-prototype.md\u0007Workbench UI flow and visual prototype\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** (\u001b[94mType: prototyp"]
[0.000, "o", "e\u001b[m).\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Interactive Flutter UI Prototype\u001b[m\r\n\n  I built a throwaway prototype in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc015db3b2e99ede8;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart\u0007prototype_workbench.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (mounted via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2c6669b91ce589e2;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/main.dart\u0007main.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) with \u001b[1m3 structurally different\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mMaterial 3 workbench layouts\u001b[m, pre-loaded with sample components (\u001b[94m0603\u001b[m passives, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m ICs, \u001b[94mESP32-S3\u001b[m, and unassigned\r\n  LCSC parts) and switchable live from the floating bottom bar (\u001b[94m←\u001b[m / \u001b[94m→\u001b[m or tap to switch):\r\n\n  • \u001b[94mVariant A\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mSplit Tabs & Dense Stepper Rows\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaac103b9bd1d5edd;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L698-L716\u0007VariantASplitTabsDenseRows\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[70D• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Classic 2-tab bottom \u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m | \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m).\n\u001b[63D• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Sticky search bar + filter chips (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPassives\u001b[m, \u001b[94mICs & MCUs\u001b[m) above\r\n\u001b[6Ca dense single-line-per-part list where every row has an inline \u001b[94m[-1] Qty [+1]\u001b[m stepper pill and a prominent\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mLocation badge\u001b[m (\u001b[94mSMD Binder #1 · Page 4 · Strip 2\u001b[m). Tapping a row opens the full Part Detail bottom sheet (with\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10 / Set…\u001b[m, specs table, and PDF datasheet button).\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant B\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mDark Command Bar & Inline Accordion\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaa4f00b63b3cad4f;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L999-L1019\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[76D• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Single-screen dark OLED \"command\" interface with no bottom tab bar; top terminal-style omnibox\r\n\u001b[6Csearches par\r\n\n⣾  \u001b[94mGener\u001b[90mating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m──────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\u001b[m\r\u001b[2A\u001b[2C\u001b[?2026l"]
