[0.000, "o", "1 / +1 / +10 / Set…\u001b[m, specs table, and PDF datasheet button).\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant B\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mDark Command Bar & Inline Accordion\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk959a83beba873db6;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L999-L1019\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[76D• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Single-screen dark OLED \"command\" interface with no bottom tab bar; top terminal-style omnibox\r\n\u001b[6Csearches parts, specs, and slots simultaneously, with a \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m toggle.\n\u001b[82D• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Tapping a part card expands it \u001b[1min place\u001b[m (accordion style) to reveal its electrical \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cchips and \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10\u001b[m stock buttons without opening a modal or losing scroll context.\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant C\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mPhysical Container & Slot Grid\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd244ba38119d02a1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L123"]
