[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A\u001b[1m### Interactive Flutter UI Prototype\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I built a throwaway prototype in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf93eb1438a2e9b;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart\u0007prototype_workbench.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (mounted via \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk437c9fb1d24a9edb;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/main.dart\u0007main.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) with \u001b[1m3 structurally different\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mMaterial 3 workbench layouts\u001b[m, pre-loaded with sample components (\u001b[94m0603\u001b[m passives, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m ICs, \u001b[94mESP32-S3\u001b[m, and unassigned\r\n  LCSC parts) and switchable live from the floating bottom bar (\u001b[94m←\u001b[m / \u001b[94m→\u001b[m or tap to switch):\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mVariant A\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mSplit Tabs & Dense Stepper Rows\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9a786e38af3c084a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L698-L716\u0007VariantASplitTabsDenseRows\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n      • \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Classic 2-t"]
[0.000, "o", "ab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m | \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\t\u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Sticky search bar + filter chips (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPassives\u001b[m, \u001b[94mICs & MCUs\u001b[m) above\r\n\u001b[6Ca dense single-line-per-part list where every row has an inline \u001b[94m[-1] Qty [+1]\u001b[m stepper pill and a prominent\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[1mLocation badge\u001b[m (\u001b[94mSMD Binder #1 · Page 4 · Strip 2\u001b[m). Tapping a row opens the full Part Detail bottom sheet (with\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10 / Set…\u001b[m, specs table, and PDF datasheet button).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant B\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mDark Command Bar & Inline Accordion\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkac216c5eae7b6796;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L999-L1019\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\n      • \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Single-screen dark OLED \"command\" interface with no bottom tab bar; top terminal-style omnibox\r\n\u001b[6Csearches parts, specs, and slots simultaneously, with a "]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m toggle.\u001b[K\n\u001b[82D• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Tapping a part card expands it \u001b[1min place\u001b[m (accordion style) to reveal its electrical \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cchips and \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10\u001b[m stock buttons without opening a modal or losing scroll context.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant C\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mPhysical Container & Slot Grid\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk31430d85c4855581;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1233-L1251\u0007VariantCPhysicalContainerGrid\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Physical-storage-first view with a horizontal carousel of \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m (\u001b[94mAll Bench Bins\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSMD Binder #1\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mIC Drawer Cabinet\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPassives Grid Box A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned Tray\u001b[m) at the top and a 2-column \u001b[1mCompartment Slot Grid\u001b[m below.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Visualizes the workbench like physical drawers/cells, with \u001b[94m-1 / +1\u001b[m buttons directly\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cinside each slot card.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "K\n\n  All three variants share the interactive \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part sheet\u001b[m (tap \u001b[94m+\u001b[m), where you can test typing or tapping sample\r\n  LCSC codes (\u001b[94mC1525\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC2040\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m) to see simulated \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m auto-fill, duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warnings (\u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m),\u001b[K\r\n  and 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Cont\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\u001b[16D\u001b[?2026l"]
