[0.000, "o", "nder #1 · Page 4 · Strip 2\u001b[m). Tapping a row opens the full Part Detail bottom sheet (with\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10 / Set…\u001b[m, specs table, and PDF datasheet button).\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant B\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mDark Command Bar & Inline Accordion\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb674d7829dddd067;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L999-L1019\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[76D• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Single-screen dark OLED \"command\" interface with no bottom tab bar; top terminal-style omnibox\r\n\u001b[6Csearches parts, specs, and slots simultaneously, with a \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m toggle.\n\u001b[82D• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Tapping a part card expands it \u001b[1min place\u001b[m (accordion style) to reveal its electrical \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cchips and \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10\u001b[m stock buttons without opening a modal or losing scroll context.\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant C\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mPhysical Container & Slot Grid\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd7fcb04e2082"]
[0.000, "o", "ac4e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1233-L1251\u0007VariantCPhysicalContainerGrid\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[72D• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Physical-storage-first view with a horizontal carousel of \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m (\u001b[94mAll Bench Bins\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSMD Binder #1\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mIC Drawer Cabinet\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPassives Grid Box A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned Tray\u001b[m) at the top and a 2-column \u001b[1mCompartment Slot Grid\u001b[m below.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Visualizes the workbench like physical drawers/cells, with \u001b[94m-1 / +1\u001b[m buttons directly\r\n\u001b[6Cinside each slot card.\r\n\n\n  All three variants share the interactive \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part sheet\u001b[m (tap \u001b[94m+\u001b[m), where you can test typing or tapping sample\r\n  LCSC codes (\u001b[94mC1525\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC2040\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m) to see simulated \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m auto-fill, duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warnings (\u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m),\r\n  and 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m collision checks.\r\n\n  You can run it directly on your connected iPhone simu"]
