[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A  • \u001b[94mVariant B\u001b[m\u001b[1m (\u001b[m\u001b[94mDark Command Bar & Inline Accordion\u001b[m\u001b[1m)\u001b[m — \u001b]8;id=jk24b5073a881a95b5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L999-L1019\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mV\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mB\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mD\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mk\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mA\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Single-screen dark OLED \"command\" interface with no bottom tab bar; top terminal-style omnibox\r\n\u001b[6Csearches parts, specs, and slots simultaneously, with a \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m toggle.\n\u001b[82D• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Tapping a part card expands it \u001b[1min place\u001b[m (accordion style) to reveal its electrical \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cchips and \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10\u001b[m s"]
[0.000, "o", "tock buttons without opening a modal or losing scroll context.\r\n  • \u001b[94mVariant C\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mPhysical Container & Slot Grid\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m — \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke48faffd21100140;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1233-L1251\u0007VariantCPhysicalContainerGrid\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\u001b[72D• \u001b[1mLayout\u001b[m: Physical-storage-first view with a horizontal carousel of \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m (\u001b[94mAll Bench Bins\u001b[m, \u001b[94mSMD Binder #1\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mIC Drawer Cabinet\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPassives Grid Box A\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned Tray\u001b[m) at the top and a 2-column \u001b[1mCompartment Slot Grid\u001b[m below.\r\n\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mPrimary affordance\u001b[m: Visualizes the workbench like physical drawers/cells, with \u001b[94m-1 / +1\u001b[m buttons directly\r\n\u001b[6Cinside each slot card.\r\n\n\n  All three variants share the interactive \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part sheet\u001b[m (tap \u001b[94m+\u001b[m), where you can test typing or tapping sample\r\n  LCSC codes (\u001b[94mC1525\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC2040\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m) to see simulated \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m aut"]
[0.000, "o", "o-fill, duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warnings (\u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m),\r\n  and 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m collision checks.\r\n\n  You can run it directly on your connected iPhone simulator or in Chrome:\n\n\u001b[70D\u001b[38;5;252mflutter run -d 110F4146-D907-4E14-8AE8-453F310E8A84\u001b[m\n\u001b[51D\u001b[38;5;246;3m# or\u001b[m\n\u001b[4D\u001b[38;5;252mflutter run -d chrome\u001b[m\r\n  ──────\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mTop-level navigation & primary workbench layout\u001b[m: After trying or reviewing the three variants, which\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\r\n  overall structure feels right for V1 (or which pieces from \u001b[1mA\u001b[m, \u001b[1mB\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mC\u001b[m do you want to combine)?\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\r\n  inside\r\n⡿  \u001b[94mW\u001b[90morking...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────"]
