[0.486, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  All three variants share the interactive \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part sheet\u001b[m (tap \u001b[94m+\u001b[m), where you can test typing or tapping sample\r\n  LCSC codes (\u001b[94mC1525\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC2040\u001b[m, \u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m) to see simulated \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m auto-fill, duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warnings (\u001b[94mC25804\u001b[m),\r\n  and 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m collision checks.\r\n\n  You can run it directly on your connected iPhone simulator or in Chrome:\n\n\u001b[70D\u001b[38;5;252mflutter run -d 110F4146-D907-4E14-8AE8-453F310E8A84\u001b[m\n\u001b[51D\u001b[38;5;246;3m# or\u001b[m\n\u001b[4D\u001b[38;5;252mflutter run -d chrome\u001b[m\r\n  ──────\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mTop-level navigation & primary workbench layout\u001b[m: After trying or reviewing the three variants, which\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\r\n  overall structure feels right for V1 (or which pieces from \u001b[1mA\u001b[m, \u001b[1mB\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mC\u001b[m do you want to combine)?\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\r\n  inside the \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m tab use Variant C's container switcher + 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m grid / list.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Variant B single-screen command list)\u001b[m: Drop the bottom tab bar in favor of a single unified search\r\n  screen with inline accordion expansion.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 3 (Variant C container-first home screen)\u001b[m: Lead with the physical \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m carousel and 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m\r\n  grid on the main screen.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A's 2-tab \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m structure with dense inline \u001b[94;22m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[39;1m rows on the \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m tab,\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mcombined with Variant C's visual slot cards inside the \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m tab)\u001b[m — it makes \"find a part & tweak stock in one\r\n  tap\" the fastest path while giving physical container browsing its own dedicated space.\r\n\n\u001b[9"]
