[0.067, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\r\n  inside the \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m tab use Variant C's container switcher + 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m grid / list.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Variant B single-screen command list)\u001b[m: Drop the bottom tab bar in favor of a single unified search\r\n  screen with inline accordion expansion.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 3 (Variant C container-first home screen)\u001b[m: Lead with the physical \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m carousel and 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m\r\n  grid on the main screen.\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7h\u001b[1G\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A's 2-tab \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m structure with dense inline \u001b[94;22m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[39;1m rows on the \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m tab,\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mcombined with Variant C's visual slot cards inside"]
