[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[26A  overall structure feels right for V1 (or which pieces from \u001b[1mA\u001b[m, \u001b[1mB\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mC\u001b[m do you want to combine)?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\r\n  inside the \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m tab use Variant C's container switcher + 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m grid / list.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Variant B single-screen command list)\u001b[m: Drop the bottom tab bar in favor of a single unified search\r\n  screen with inline accordion expansion.\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 3 (Variant C container-first home screen)\u001b[m: Lead with the physical \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m carousel and 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m\r\n  grid on the main screen.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A's 2-tab \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m structure with dense inline \u001b[94;22m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[39;1m rows on t"]
[0.000, "o", "he \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m tab,\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mcombined with Variant C's visual slot cards inside the \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m tab)\u001b[m — it makes \"find a part & tweak stock in one\r\n  tap\" the fastest path while giving physical container browsing its own dedicated space.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> please run the app\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 8.3s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The system prompt requires either proceeding with other tasks or providing a status update. Sin...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(flutter run -d 110F4146-D907-4E14-8AE8-453F310E8A84)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mScheduled\u001b[m 1 timer \u001b[37m(15s: Check if the iOS simulator build finished and the app is running.)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  I have launched \u001b[94mflutter run\u001b[m on the \u001b[1miPhone 18 Pro\u001b[m simulator and am waiting for the Xcode build to finish so the app\r\n  open"]
