[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27AThe prototype is now running live on the \u001b[1miPhone 18 Pro\u001b[m simulator (and I also hot-reloaded a fix for the header row\r\n  overflow in Variant B).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  You can use the floating pill at the bottom to cycle between:\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[94mA (Split Tabs & Dense Stepper Rows)\u001b[m\n\u001b[35D\u001b[94mB (Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion)\u001b[m\n\u001b[39D\u001b[94mC (Physical Container & Slot Grid)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Whenever you've had a chance to click around:\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mTop-level navigation & primary workbench layout\u001b[m: Which overall structure feels right for V1 (or which\u001b[?7h\u001b[112G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  pieces from \u001b[1mA\u001b[m, \u001b[1mB\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mC\u001b[m would you like to combine)?\u001b[?7h\u001b[54G\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\u001b[K\r\n  inside the \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m tab use Variant C"]
