[7.066, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[30A\u001b[K\n  Whenever you've had a chance to click around:\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mTop-level navigation & primary workbench layout\u001b[m: Which overall structure feels right for V1 (or which\u001b[?7h\u001b[112G\r\n  pieces from \u001b[1mA\u001b[m, \u001b[1mB\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mC\u001b[m would you like to combine)?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\u001b[K\r\n  inside the \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m tab use Variant C's container switcher + 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m grid / list.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Variant B single-screen command list)\u001b[m: Drop the bottom tab bar in favor of a single unified search\u001b[K\r\n  screen with inline accordion expansion.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 3 (Variant C container-first home screen)\u001b[m: Lead with the physical \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m carousel and 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  grid on th"]
[0.000, "o", "e main screen.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A's 2-tab \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m structure with dense inline \u001b[94;22m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[39;1m rows on the \u001b[94;22mParts\u001b[39;1m tab,\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mcombined with Variant C's visual slot cards inside the \u001b[94;22mStorage\u001b[39;1m tab)\u001b[m — it keeps part search + 1-tap stock steppers\u001b[K\r\n  front and center while giving physical container browsing a dedicated visual view.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> I like option B, but it has over runs\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 41.7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The UI appears to have conflicting implementations of increment/decrement buttons for quantity...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 2 files \u001b[37m(prototype_workbench.dart, task-44.log)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(prototype_workbench.dart)"]
