[5.882, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[30A\u001b[K\n  Whenever you've had a chance to click around:\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mTop-level navigation & primary workbench layout\u001b[m: Which overall structure feels right for V1 (or which\u001b[?7h\u001b[112G\r\n  pieces from \u001b[1mA\u001b[m, \u001b[1mB\u001b[m, and \u001b[1mC\u001b[m would you like to combine)?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Variant A foundation + Variant C's grid in the Storage tab)\u001b[m: Use Variant A's 2-tab bottom \u001b[94mNavigationBar\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  (\u001b[1mParts\u001b[m for fast search/filter + dense inline \u001b[94m[-1] qty [+1]\u001b[m rows; \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m for browsing physical \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m), and\u001b[K\r\n  inside the \u001b[1mStorage\u001b[m tab use Variant C's container switcher + 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m grid / list.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Variant B single-screen command list)\u001b[m: Drop the bottom tab bar in favor of a single unified search\r\n  screen with inline accordion expansion.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 3 (Variant C container-first home screen)\u001b[m: Lead with the physical \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m carousel and 2-column \u001b[1mSlot\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  grid on the m"]
