[0.051, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[26A\u001b[K\r\n  I fixed the horizontal overruns in \u001b]8;id=jk5837a51dfe755cd0;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1747-L1767\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mV\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mt\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mB\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mD\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mk\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mm\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mA\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mr\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mn\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ (both in the top command header and inside the\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  expanded accordion/detail action bars) and hot-reloaded the simulator—plus wired the \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m chip in\r\n  Variant B so toggling it groups the cards under each physical \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m (\u001b[94mSMD Binder #1\u001b[m, \u001b[94mIC Drawer Cabinet\u001b[m, \u001b[94mPassives\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mGrid Box A\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m).\r\n\n  With \u001b[1mVariant B (Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion)\u001b[m as our cho"]
[0.000, "o", "sen foundation:\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mFilter chips & Container management in the Variant B command header\u001b[m: Alongside the top search omnibox and\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  the \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m toggle, what quick filters and container management controls should live on this screen?\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Quick filter chips + Containers manage sheet)\u001b[m: Add horizontal quick-filter chips directly below the\r\n  search bar (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, plus dynamic \u001b[94mCategory\u001b[m chips) and a compact \u001b[94mContainers\u001b[39;1m button\u001b[m in the header\r\n  (or when \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m is active) to create, rename, or delete \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m (and trigger JSON export/import from\r\n  a gear/backup icon).\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Search-only header)\u001b[m: Keep only the \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m chip in the header and rely on typing into the\r\n  search bar for filtering.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Quick filter chips \u001b[94;22mAll\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mLow Stock\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mUnassigned\u001b[39;"]
[0.000, "o", "1m / Categories below the search bar + header actions for\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mmanaging \u001b[94;22mContainers\u001b[39;1m and Backup/Import)\u001b[m — so one-tap filtering for low stock or unassigned inbox items works without\r\n  typing.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> 1\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 6.7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Updating the `VariantBDarkCommandAccordion` in the prototype workbench to include quick-filter...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mUsing\u001b[m ReadFile \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⣽  \u001b[90mUpdating the `Var\u001b[94miantB\u001b[90mDarkCommandAccordion` in the prototype workbench to include quick-filter chips and the Conta...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
