[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27A\u001b[94mGrid Box A\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  With \u001b[1mVariant B (Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion)\u001b[m as our chosen foundation:\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mFilter chips & Container management in the Variant B command header\u001b[m: Alongside the top search omnibox and\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  the \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m toggle, what quick filters and container management controls should live on this screen?\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption 1 (Quick filter chips + Containers manage sheet)\u001b[m: Add horizontal quick-filter chips directly below the\r\n  search bar (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, plus dynamic \u001b[94mCategory\u001b[m chips) and a compact \u001b[94mContainers\u001b[39;1m button\u001b[m in the header\r\n  (or when \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m is active) to create, rename, or delete \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m (and trigger JSON export/import from\r\n  a gear/backup icon).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Search-only header)\u001b[m: Keep only the \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m chip in the header and rely on ty"]
[0.000, "o", "ping into the\r\n  search bar for filtering.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Quick filter chips \u001b[94;22mAll\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mLow Stock\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mUnassigned\u001b[39;1m / Categories below the search bar + header actions for\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mmanaging \u001b[94;22mContainers\u001b[39;1m and Backup/Import)\u001b[m — so one-tap filtering for low stock or unassigned inbox items works without\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\r\n  typing.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> 1\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThinking...\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(prototype_workbench.dart)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEditing\u001b[m \u001b[P\n\u001b[7D\u001b[90mI'\u001b[m\n\n\n\b\b\b\u001b[?2026l"]
