[0.000, "o", "kup icon).\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption 2 (Search-only header)\u001b[m: Keep only the \u001b[94mGroup by Container\u001b[m chip in the header and rely on typing into the\r\n  search bar for filtering.\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption 1 (Quick filter chips \u001b[94;22mAll\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mLow Stock\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mUnassigned\u001b[39;1m / Categories below the search bar + header actions for\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mmanaging \u001b[94;22mContainers\u001b[39;1m and Backup/Import)\u001b[m — so one-tap filtering for low stock or unassigned inbox items works without\r\n  typing.\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> 1\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThinking...\u001b[m \u001b[37m(I'm thinking through how to approach this.)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(prototype_workbench.dart)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEditing\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(prototype_workbench.dart)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⣟  \u001b[90mI'm thinking through how"]
