[0.049, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[31A\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 8s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  I hot-reloaded Variant B (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8a090578076e7f1d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1747-L1767\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) with:\r\n\u001b[K\n  • A horizontal chip bar below the command omnibox (\u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m toggle + \u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, and dynamic\r\n  category chips).\u001b[K\r\n  • A \u001b[1mManage Containers\u001b[m icon button next to \u001b[1mNew\u001b[m in the command header.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mInline Accordion Controls, Add/Edit Sheet & Theme Lock\u001b[m: Does the current Variant B interaction loop feel\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ready to lock as our V1 UI design?\u001b[?7h\u001b[37G\r\n\u001b[K\n  Specifically:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mCollapsed card\u001b[m: Shows the monospace \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m badge (highlighted in red/error when \u001b[94mquantity <= lowStockThreshold\u001b[m),\r\n  \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and a monospace subtitle (\u001b[94mContainer · Slot • Package • Cx"]
[0.001, "o", "\u001b[5b\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mExpanded inline accordion\u001b[m: Reveals all \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m chips (\u001b[94mKey: Value\u001b[m), quick stock adjustment buttons (\u001b[94m-10\u001b[m, \u001b[94m-1\u001b[m, \u001b[94m+1\u001b[m, \u001b[94m+\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m10\u001b[m, plus \u001b[94mSet…\u001b[m), and a \u001b[94mDetails & Edit\u001b[m button that opens the full Part Detail / Edit bottom sheet (notes, datasheet\u001b[K\r\n  link, full field editing).\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part bottom sheet\u001b[m: Top LCSC \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m field + \u001b[94mFetch LCSC\u001b[m button that pre-fills editable fields & specs,\r\n  inline duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warning with \u001b[94mJump to Part\u001b[m, and a \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m dropdown + \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m text field with 1-to-1 slot\u001b[K\r\n  conflict validation.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mVisual theme\u001b[m: Dark industrial Material 3 theme (\u001b[94m#0E1318\u001b[m / \u001b[94m#161D24\u001b[m surfaces, cyan \u001b[94m#00E5FF\u001b[m seed accent, monospace\r\n  badges for quantities, packages, slots, and LCSC codes).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ **Yes — lock Variant B's **\u001b[?7h\u001b[33G\r\n⣽  \u001b[90mGenerating\u001b[94m...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────"]
