[0.066, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[26A  category chips).\u001b[K\r\n  • A \u001b[1mManage Containers\u001b[m icon button next to \u001b[1mNew\u001b[m in the command header.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  ──────\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mInline Accordion Controls, Add/Edit Sheet & Theme Lock\u001b[m: Does the current Variant B interaction loop feel\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\r\n  ready to lock as our V1 UI design?\r\n\n  Specifically:\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mCollapsed card\u001b[m: Shows the monospace \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m badge (highlighted in red/error when \u001b[94mquantity <= lowStockThreshold\u001b[m),\r\n  \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and a monospace subtitle (\u001b[94mContainer · Slot • Package • Cx\u001b[5b\u001b[m).\r\n  2. \u001b[1mExpanded inline accordion\u001b[m: Reveals all \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m chips (\u001b[94mKey: Value\u001b[m), quick stock adjustment buttons (\u001b[94m-10\u001b[m, \u001b[94m-1\u001b[m, \u001b[94m+1\u001b[m, \u001b[94m+\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m10\u001b[m, plus \u001b[94mSet…\u001b[m), and a \u001b[94mDetails & Edit\u001b[m button that opens the full Part Detail / Edit bottom sheet (notes, datasheet\r\n  link, full field editing).\r\n  3. \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part bottom sheet\u001b[m: Top LCSC \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m field + \u001b["]
