[0.000, "o", "nd \u001b[94mDetails & Edit\u001b[m.\r\n  • \u001b[1mSheets & Theme\u001b[m:\n\u001b[13D• \u001b[1mPart Detail Sheet\u001b[m with \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10 / Set…\u001b[m quantity controls, workbench notes, full key-value \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Ctable, and LCSC PDF datasheet launcher.\n\u001b[39D• \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part Sheet\u001b[m leading with LCSC \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m lookup (\u001b[94mFetch LCSC\u001b[m), inline duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warning (\u001b[94mJump\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mto Part\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m + \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m inputs with 1-to-1 slot conflict validation.\n\u001b[75D• Da\r\n\n⡿  \u001b[90mLoa\u001b[94mding.\u001b[90m..\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────"]
