[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[27A• \u001b[1mPrimary Layout (\u001b[94;22mVariant B: Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n      • Top monospace search omnibox (\u001b[94m⌘ Find\u001b[m), \u001b[1mManage Containers\u001b[m sheet button, and \u001b[94m+ New\u001b[m part button.\r\n\tHorizontal chip bar with a leading \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m grouping toggle (\u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m + each \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m with \u001b[94m+ Add Slot\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cactions) and quick-filter chips (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, plus dynamic category chips).\u001b[K\n\u001b[90D• Inline accordion part cards: collapsed rows show the monospace \u001b[94mquantity\u001b[m badge (highlighted when \u001b[94mquantity <=\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mlowStockThreshold\u001b[m), bold \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mContainer · Slot • Package • Cx\u001b[5b\u001b[m subtitle; tapping expands in-place to\r\n\u001b[6Cshow \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m chips, \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10\u001b[m stock buttons, and \u001b[94mDetails & Edit\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mSheets & Theme\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mPart Detail Sheet\u001b[m with \u001b[94m-10 / -1 / +1 / +10 / Set…\u001b[m quantity controls, workbench note"]
[0.000, "o", "s, full key-value \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Ctable, and LCSC PDF datasheet launcher.\u001b[K\n\u001b[39D• \u001b[1mAdd / Edit Part Sheet\u001b[m leading with LCSC \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m lookup (\u001b[94mFetch LCSC\u001b[m), inline duplicate \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m warning (\u001b[94mJump\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mto Part\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m + \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m inputs with 1-to-1 slot conflict validation.\u001b[K\n\u001b[75D• Dark OLED Material 3 theme (\u001b[94m#0E1318\u001b[m / \u001b[94m#161D24\u001b[m surfaces, \u001b[94m#00E5FF\u001b[m seed accent, monospace badges).\r\n  • \u001b[1mPrototype Archive\u001b[m: Saved to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1752ea3246eb802e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/prototypes/04-workbench-ui-prototype.dart\u000704-workbench-ui-prototype.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and defaulted to Variant B in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk32a87d5c183edace;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart\u0007prototype_workbench.dart\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[1mGraduated Fog\u001b[m: Graduated **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk13abf0ac25ce243f;file:///Users/brett/Demos"]
