[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[27A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes — use validated full-snapshot replace with a confirmation summary, automatic \u001b[94;22mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[39;1m pre-\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[m\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[96D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka9053ddf61638174;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/05-on-device-json-persistence-and-import-export.md\u0007On-device JSON persistence, schema versioning, and iOS Files export/import\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\u001b[43D\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf52a5a64e9d707c5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/ios/Runner/Info.plist\u0007Info.plist\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[35C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9da505c93e532d3a;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\u001b[62Da clear erro\r\n\n⣯ \n\n\n\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[28A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mYes — use validated full-snapshot replace with a confirmation summary, automatic \u001b[94;22mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[39;1m pre-\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mimport backup, strict invariant validation (duplicate IDs, 1-to-1 \u001b[94;22m(containerId, slot)\u001b[39;1m, and valid \u001b[94;22mcontainerId\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mreferences), and unassign parts (\u001b[94;22mcontainerId: null, slot: null\u001b[39;1m) when a Container is deleted.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 11s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Every branch of **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1d61765e8445dc4c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/05-on-device-json-persistence-and-import-export.md\u0007On-device JSON persistence, schema versioning, and iOS Files export/import\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** is settled:\r\n\u001b[K"]
[0.000, "o", "\n  1. \u001b[1mLive File Location, iOS Files Visibility, and Atomic Writes\u001b[m:\r\n      • Live catalog stored at \u001b[94mgetApplicationDocumentsDirectory()/parts_catalog.json\u001b[m with \u001b[94mUIFileSharingEnabled\u001b[m and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mLSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace\u001b[m enabled in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkfb12277539b2a53d;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/ios/Runner/Info.plist\u0007Info.plist\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so it is accessible in \u001b[1mOn My iPhone › Parts Tracker\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• Paired with in-app \u001b[1mExport Backup\u001b[m (Share Sheet exporting \u001b[94mparts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mImport Backup\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C(File Picker).\u001b[K\n\u001b[14D• Every mutation writes immediately via a serialized async queue using atomic write-to-temp + rename\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mparts_catalog.json.tmp\u001b[m → \u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m) with 2-space pretty-printed JSON.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSchema Envelope & Versioning (\u001b[94;22mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Identical top-level JSON structure for both live storage and exported backups: \u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "94mschemaVersion\u001b[m (\u001b[94m1\u001b[m), \u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(ISO-8601 UTC string), \u001b[94mcontainers\u001b[m (\u001b[94mList<Container>\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m (\u001b[94mList<Part>\u001b[m), aligned with \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcf4a25af0c40e662;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C• First launch with no existing file initializes an empty v1 catalog (\u001b[94mcontainers: []\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparts: []\u001b[m); unsupported\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mschemaVersion\u001b[m values are rejected with a clear error message.\u001b[K\n\u001b[61D3\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[5D\u001b[?2026l"]
