[0.000, "o", "hone › Parts Tracker\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• Paired with in-app \u001b[1mExport Backup\u001b[m (Share Sheet exporting \u001b[94mparts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mImport Backup\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(File Picker).\n\u001b[14D• Every mutation writes immediately via a serialized async queue using atomic write-to-temp + rename\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mparts_catalog.json.tmp\u001b[m → \u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m) with 2-space pretty-printed JSON.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSchema Envelope & Versioning (\u001b[94;22mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\n\u001b[47D• Identical top-level JSON structure for both live storage and exported backups: \u001b[94mschemaVersion\u001b[m (\u001b[94m1\u001b[m), \u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(ISO-8601 UTC string), \u001b[94mcontainers\u001b[m (\u001b[94mList<Container>\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m (\u001b[94mList<Part>\u001b[m), aligned with \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkceddb1bc40d50ab3;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n\u001b[6C• First launch with no existing file initializes an empty v1 catalog (\u001b[94mcontainers: []\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparts: []\u001b[m); unsupported\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94msc"]
[0.000, "o", "hemaVersion\u001b[m values are rejected with a clear error message.\r\n  3. \u001b[1mImport Semantics, Safety Backup, and Referential Integrity\u001b[m:\n\u001b[58D• \u001b[1mFull-snapshot replace\u001b[m with a confirmation dialog comparing current vs. incoming part/container counts and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m timestamp, writing a pre-import safety copy to \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m before overwriting\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m.\n\u001b[19D• \u001b[1mAll-or-nothing validation\u001b[m rejects malformed JSON, unsupported \u001b[94mschemaVersion\u001b[m, missing required fields (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mquantity >= 0\u001b[m), duplicate \u001b[94mid\u001b[ms, duplicate non-empty \u001b[94m(containerId, slot)\u001b[m pairs, or dangling \u001b[94mcontainerId\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Creferences.\r\n\n⣾  \u001b[90mGenerating...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /help to see all commands.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
