[0.166, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  1. \u001b[1mLive File Location, iOS Files Visibility, and Atomic Writes\u001b[m:\r\n      • Live catalog stored at \u001b[94mgetApplicationDocumentsDirectory()/parts_catalog.json\u001b[m with \u001b[94mUIFileSharingEnabled\u001b[m and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mLSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace\u001b[m enabled in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk9a2a4e70263b4742;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/ios/Runner/Info.plist\u0007Info.plist\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 so it is accessible in \u001b[1mOn My iPhone › Parts Tracker\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[6C• Paired with in-app \u001b[1mExport Backup\u001b[m (Share Sheet exporting \u001b[94mparts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json\u001b[m) and \u001b[1mImport Backup\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C(File Picker).\u001b[K\n\u001b[14D• Every mutation writes immediately via a serialized async queue using atomic write-to-temp + rename\r\n\u001b[6C(\u001b[94mparts_catalog.json.tmp\u001b[m → \u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m) with 2-space pretty-printed JSON.\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSchema Envelope & Versioning (\u001b[94;22mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Identical top-level JSON structure for both live storage and exporte"]
[0.000, "o", "d backups: \u001b[94mschemaVersion\u001b[m (\u001b[94m1\u001b[m), \u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C(ISO-8601 UTC string), \u001b[94mcontainers\u001b[m (\u001b[94mList<Container>\u001b[m), and \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m (\u001b[94mList<Part>\u001b[m), aligned with \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkbdeb8ded854703a1;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C• First launch with no existing file initializes an empty v1 catalog (\u001b[94mcontainers: []\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparts: []\u001b[m); unsupported\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mschemaVersion\u001b[m values are rejected with a clear error message.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mImport Semantics, Safety Backup, and Referential Integrity\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mFull-snapshot replace\u001b[m with a confirmation dialog comparing current vs. incoming part/container counts and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m timestamp, writing a pre-import safety copy to \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m before overwriting\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[19D• \u001b[1mAll-or-nothing validation\u001b[m rejects malformed JSON, unsupported \u001b[94mschemaVersion\u001b[m, missing required"]
[0.000, "o", " fields (\u001b[94mid\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mquantity >= 0\u001b[m), duplicate \u001b[94mid\u001b[ms, duplicate non-empty \u001b[94m(containerId, slot)\u001b[m pairs, or dangling \u001b[94mcontainerId\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Creferences.\u001b[K\n\u001b[11D• Deleting a \u001b[1mContainer\u001b[m in the app atomically unassigns its parts (\u001b[94mcontainerId: null, slot: null\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  Do you confirm we have reached a shared understanding so I can resolve\r\n  **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkd27582830ab8d020;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/05-on-device-json-persistence-and-import-export.md\u0007On-device JSON persistence, schema versioning, and iOS Files export/import\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** and update the map?\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n⣟  \u001b[90mGenerat\u001b[94ming..\u001b[90m.\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m───────────────────"]
