[0.000, "o", "nts directory, whether\r\n\t\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`UIFileSharingEnabled`\u001b[m / \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`LSSupportsOpeningDocumentsInPlace`\u001b[m should expose the live file directly in the iOS\r\n\t\u001b[37m\u001b[1K Files app), atomic write strategy (write-to-temp + rename), and auto-save debouncing.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m11 \u001b[m    2. **Schema & versioning**: Top-level JSON envelope (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`schemaVersion`\u001b[m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`exportedAt`\u001b[m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`parts`\u001b[m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`locations`\u001b[m) so\r\n\t\u001b[37m\u001b[1K future app updates or desktop scripts don't break existing data.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m-  \u001b[39m3. **Import & conflict resolution**: When importing a JSON file from the iOS Files app or Share Sheet, should\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;53;13;14m \u001b[31m   \u001b[39mit **replace** the entire database, **merge** by ID/LCSC code, or prompt the user?\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m3. **Import & conflict resolution**: When importing a JSON file from the iOS File"]
