[0.000, "o", "sues/06-search-and-unit-normalization.md\u0007Catalog search, filtering, and engineering unit normalization\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007**.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Here is Round 1 to resolve the decisions for this ticket:\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ1\u001b[m - \u001b[1mEngineering Unit & Shorthand Equivalence\u001b[m: When searching across a \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m's \u001b[94mname\u001b[m and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m (from \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8f85997e3356bb43;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/GLOSSARY.md\u0007GLOSSARY.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007),\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  how far should unit normalization go?\u001b[?7h\u001b[40G\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption A (Canonical SI + R-notation normalization + Unicode folding)\u001b[m: Normalize both indexed part text (\u001b[94mname\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m values) and query tokens in two ways:\u001b[K\r\n      1. \u001b[1mText folding\u001b[m: Case-insensitive matching with Unicode symbol folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m/\u001b[94mμ\u001b[m → \u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohms\u001b[m → \u001b[94mr\u001b[m, stripping \u001b[94m±\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C2. \u001b[1mCanonical engineering value matching\u001b[m: Parse expl"]
[0.000, "o", "icitly unit/prefix-marked tokens—both standard SI (\u001b[94m4.7k\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m7kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100mΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m10\u001b[4bpF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.7uH\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) and EE infix shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100r\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4r7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m, \u001b[94m2n2\u001b[m)—into\r\n\u001b[6Ccanonical \u001b[94m(Dimension, baseValue)\u001b[m pairs (Resistance in Ω, Capacitance in F, Inductance in H, Voltage in V,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6CCurrent in A, Power in W, Frequency in Hz) compared within floating-point tolerance (10⁻⁶ relative). Do \u001b[1mnot\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cexpand bar\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\n\u001b[14D\u001b[?2026l"]
