[0.101, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[14A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m: Canonical SI + EE infix shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) plus Unicode\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mMulti-Token Query Semantics, Searchable Fields, and Ordering\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6f4f2de1abe26155;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1796-L1806\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion._filtered\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\r\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⣻  \u001b[94mWork\u001b[m\n\n\n\u001b[5D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.067, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mOption A (Canonical SI + R-notation normalization + Unicode folding)\u001b[m: Normalize both indexed part text (\u001b[94mname\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m values) and query tokens in two ways:\u001b[K\r\n      1. \u001b[1mText folding\u001b[m: Case-insensitive matching with Unicode symbol folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m/\u001b[94mμ\u001b[m → \u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohms\u001b[m → \u001b[94mr\u001b[m, stripping \u001b[94m±\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C2. \u001b[1mCanonical engineering value matching\u001b[m: Parse explicitly unit/prefix-marked tokens—both standard SI (\u001b[94m4.7k\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m7kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100mΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m10\u001b[4bpF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.7uH\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) and EE infix shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100r\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4r7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m, \u001b[94m2n2\u001b[m)—into\r\n\u001b[6Ccanonical \u001b[94m(Dimension, baseValue)\u001b[m pairs (Resistance in Ω, Capacitance in F, Inductance in H, Voltage in V,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6CCurrent in A, Power in W, Frequency in Hz) compared within floating-point tolerance (10⁻⁶ relative). Do \u001b[1mnot\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cexpand bar"]
[0.000, "o", "e 3-digit EIA numbers like \u001b[94m104\u001b[m into \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m/\u001b[94m100kΩ\u001b[m (avoiding false positives against \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m codes and\r\n\u001b[6Cquantities; \u001b[94m104\u001b[m still matches MPNs like \u001b[94mCL10B104KB8NNNC\u001b[m via substring).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (Include 3-digit EIA code expansion)\u001b[m: Everything in Option A, plus expanding 3-digit numbers like \u001b[94m104\u001b[m or\r\n  \u001b[94m472\u001b[m into equivalent capacitance/resistance values.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption C (Substring + Unicode folding only)\u001b[m: Only fold \u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m and \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m without cross-unit numeric equivalence (\u001b[94m0.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m1uF\u001b[m would not match \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m would not match \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m: Canonical SI + EE infix shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) plus Unicode\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m), while leaving bare 3-di"]
[0.000, "o", "git codes (\u001b[94m104\u001b[m) to normal substring matching against \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m/\u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m.\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mMulti-Token Query Semantics, Searchable Fields, and Ordering\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk3cb5f4b6cbdab539;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1796-L1806\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion._filtered\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  the prototype matched the entire query as a single contiguous substring (\u001b[94mhay.contains(q)\u001b[m), which fails when tokens\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n  are typed in a different order (e.g., \u001b[94m\"0603 100nF X7R\"\u001b[m). How should multi-token search and ordering work?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mSearchable fields\u001b[m: Match against \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, resolved \u001b[94mContainer.name\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m, and all \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m keys and values.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mMulti-token AND matching\u001b[m: Split the query on whitesp"]
[0.000, "o", "ace into tokens; a \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m matches if \u001b[1mevery\u001b[m token matches at\r\n  least one searchable field (via folded substring \u001b[1mor\u001b[m canonical engineering value equivalence on \u001b[94mname\u001b[m/\u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • **\u001b[K\n\u001b[C\u001b[94mi\u001b[90mn\u001b[m\n\n\n\u001b[7D\u001b[?2026l"]
