[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m: Canonical SI + EE infix shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) plus Unicode\u001b[?7h\u001b[111G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m), while leaving bare 3-digit codes (\u001b[94m104\u001b[m) to normal substring matching against \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m/\u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m.\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mMulti-Token Query Semantics, Searchable Fields, and Ordering\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk39bba4d128da2d2c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1796-L1806\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion._filtered\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007,\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  the prototype matched the entire query as a single contiguous substring (\u001b[94mhay.contains(q)\u001b[m), which fails when tokens\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n  are typed in a different order (e.g., \u001b[94m\"0603 100nF X7R\"\u001b[m). How should multi-token search and ordering work?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[K\n  • \u001b[1mSearchable fields\u001b[m: Match against \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, resolved \u001b[94mContainer.name\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m, and all \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m keys and values.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mMulti-token AND matching\u001b[m: Split the query on whitespace into tokens; a \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m matches if \u001b[1mevery\u001b[m token matches at\r\n  least one searchable field (via folded substring \u001b[1mor\u001b[m canonical engineering value equivalence on \u001b[94mname\u001b[m/\u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mSorting\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mWhen query is empty\u001b[m: In flat view, sort alphabetically by \u001b[94mname\u001b[m (case-insensitive); in \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m view, pin\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mUnassigned (Loose / Inbox)\u001b[m first, sort \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m alphabetically by \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and sort \u001b[1mParts\u001b[m within each container\r\n\u001b[6Cby natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m order (so \u001b[94m\"Page 2\"\u001b[m sorts before \u001b[94m\"Page 10\"\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m\"Drawer A2\"\u001b[m before \u001b[94m\"Drawer A10\"\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cwith bulk slot"]
[0.000, "o", "less parts last).\u001b[K\n\u001b[31D• \u001b[1mWhen query is non-empty\u001b[m: Rank by match tier—(1) exact/prefix \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m or \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m match, (2) \u001b[94mname\u001b[m or canonical\r\n\u001b[6Cengineering value match in \u001b[94mname\u001b[m/\u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m, (3) match in other fields (\u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer.name\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m,\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m)—breaking ties alphabetically by \u001b[94mname\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mAccept multi-token AND matching across all 10 fields with natural alphanumeric \u001b[94;22mslot\u001b[39;1m sorting when grouped and\u001b[?7h\u001b[114G\u001b[?7l\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[1mtiered relevance ranking when searching.\u001b[?7h\u001b[43G\u001b[m\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mFilter Facets & Combination Rules\u001b[m: In [Workbench UI flow and visual\u001b[?7h\u001b[78G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  prototype](file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-\u001b[?7h\u001b[110G\r\n  v1/issues/0\u001b[K\r\n⣾ \n\n\u001b[?2026l"]
