[0.016, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mOption A (Canonical SI + EE infix shorthand + Unicode folding)\u001b[m:\r\n      1. \u001b[1mText folding\u001b[m: Case-insensitive matching with Unicode symbol folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m/\u001b[94mμ\u001b[m → \u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohms\u001b[m → \u001b[94mr\u001b[m, stripping \u001b[94m±\u001b[m).\r\n\u001b[6C2. \u001b[1mCanonical engineering value matching\u001b[m: Parse explicitly unit/prefix-marked tokens—both standard SI (\u001b[94m4.7k\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m7kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100mΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m10\u001b[4bpF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.7uH\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) and EE infix shorthand (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100r\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4r7\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m, \u001b[94m2n2\u001b[m)—into\r\n\u001b[6Ccanonical \u001b[94m(Dimension, baseValue)\u001b[m pairs so \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m and \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m match across \u001b[94mname\u001b[m and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6CLeave bare 3-digit EIA numbers like \u001b[94m104\u001b[m to normal substring matching against \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m/\u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m (avoiding false\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cpositives against \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m codes and "]
[0.000, "o", "quantities).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (Include 3-digit EIA code expansion)\u001b[m: Everything in Option A, plus expanding bare 3-digit numbers like\r\n  \u001b[94m104\u001b[m or \u001b[94m472\u001b[m into equivalent capacitance/resistance values (\u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m / \u001b[94m100kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m4.7nF\u001b[m / \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption C (Substring + Unicode folding only)\u001b[m: Only fold \u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m and \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m/\u001b[94mohm\u001b[m without cross-unit numeric equivalence (\u001b[94m0.\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94m1uF\u001b[m would not match \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, and \u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m would not match \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m (Canonical SI + EE infix shorthand + Unicode folding, without bare 3-digit EIA expansion). Does that\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  work for you?\u001b[?7h\u001b[16G\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> A\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 23s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b["]
