[0.049, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m (Canonical SI + EE infix shorthand + Unicode folding, without bare 3-digit EIA expansion). Does that\u001b[?7h\u001b[115G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  work for you?\u001b[?7h\u001b[16G\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> A\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 23s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mSearchable Fields, Multi-Token Queries, and Result Ordering\u001b[m: In \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk5e1e4e48aaac3db3;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/lib/prototype_workbench.dart#L1796-L1806\u0007VariantBDarkCommandAccordion._filtered\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, the\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  prototype matched the entire query string as a single contiguous substring, which fails when tokens are typed in a\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\r\n  different order (e.g., \u001b[94m\"0603 100nF X7R\"\u001b[m). How should multi-token queries, searchable fields, and result ordering\u001b[K\r\n  work?"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mSearchable fields\u001b[m: Search across \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, resolved \u001b[94mContainer.name\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m (both keys and values).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mMulti-token matching\u001b[m: Split the query on whitespace into tokens using \u001b[1mAND\u001b[m semantics—a \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m matches if \u001b[1mevery\u001b[m query\r\n  token matches at least one searchable field (via folded substring \u001b[1mor\u001b[m canonical engineering value equivalence on\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[94mname\u001b[m/\u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOrdering\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mWhen query is empty\u001b[m: Sort alphabetically by \u001b[94mname\u001b[m in the flat list; in \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m view, pin \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m(Loose / Inbox)\u001b[m first, sort \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m alphabetically by \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, and sort \u001b[1mParts\u001b[m within each container by natural\r\n\u001b[6Calphanumeric \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m order (\u001b[94m\"Page 2\"\u001b[m before \u001b[94m\"Page 10\"\u001b[m, \u001b[94m\"Drawer A2\"\u001b[m before \u001b[94m\"Drawer A10\"\u001b["]
[0.000, "o", "m, with bulk slotless parts\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Clast).\u001b[K\n\u001b[6D• \u001b[1mWhen query is active\u001b[m: Rank by match tier—(1) exact/prefix \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m or \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m match, (2) \u001b[94mname\u001b[m or canonical\r\n\u001b[6Cengineering value match in \u001b[94mname\u001b[m/\u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m, (3) match in remaining fields (\u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer.name\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[23D\u001b[?2026l"]
