[0.000, "o", "\u001b[m\r\n  chips from categories present in the catalog). How should filter facets and the search omnibox combine?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption A (Single-row chip bar + AND with search)\u001b[m: Keep the chip bar to the \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m grouping toggle + single-\r\n  select status/category chips (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<Categories>\u001b[m), intersected via \u001b[1mAND\u001b[m with the active search\r\n  query (and hide containers with zero matching parts in \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m mode when a search query or non-\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m filter is\u001b[K\r\n  active). Package (\u001b[94m0603\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m) and specific container/slot filtering are handled via the search omnibox.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (Add extra filter rows/dropdowns for Package and Container)\u001b[m: Add dedicated filter chip rows or dropdowns\r\n  for \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m and \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m alongside the category chips.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m (Keep the single-row chip bar intersected via \u001b[1mAND\u001b[m with the search omnibox, hiding empty containers"]
