[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mOption A (Single-row chip bar + AND with search)\u001b[m: Keep the chip bar to the \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m grouping toggle + single-\r\n  select status/category chips (\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, \u001b[94m<Categories>\u001b[m), intersected via \u001b[1mAND\u001b[m with the active search\r\n  query (and hide containers with zero matching parts in \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m mode when a search query or non-\u001b[94mAll\u001b[m filter is\u001b[K\r\n  active). Package (\u001b[94m0603\u001b[m, \u001b[94mDIP-8\u001b[m) and specific container/slot filtering are handled via the search omnibox.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (Add extra filter rows/dropdowns for Package and Container)\u001b[m: Add dedicated filter chip rows or dropdowns\r\n  for \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m and \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m alongside the category chips.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mOption A\u001b[m (Keep the single-row chip bar intersected via \u001b[1mAND\u001b[m with the search omnibox, hiding empty containers in\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m mode when a filter or search query is active). Does that work"]
[0.000, "o", " for you?\u001b[?7h\u001b[86G\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> A\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 28.7s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(\"grilling\" correctly describes the termination condition. The frontier being empty signifies a...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 2 files \u001b[37m(06-search-and-unit-normalization.md, map.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 7s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  **\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkab5b1610660e51a2;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/06-search-and-unit-normalization.md\u0007Catalog search, filtering, and engineering unit normalization\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007** is now resolved and recorded on the\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk20e13348bd9b28;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/map.md\u0007Electronics Parts Tracker V1 Map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  "]
[0.000, "o", "• \u001b[1mEngineering Unit & Shorthand Equivalence\u001b[m: Unicode folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m) plus canonical \u001b[94m(Dimension, baseValue)\u001b[m\r\n  comparison for SI and EE infix tokens (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m) across \u001b[94mname\u001b[m and \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m,\r\n  without expanding bare 3-digit EIA numbers (\u001b[94m104\u001b[m).\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mMulti-Token AND Search & Ordering\u001b[m: Whitespace-split \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m matching across all 10 fields (\u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m,\r\n  \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m,\u001b[K\n\n\n\n\u001b[13D\u001b[?2026l"]
