[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?7l\r\u001b[11A\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mRecommend yes\u001b[m: Use these exact three modules (\u001b[94mCatalogStore\u001b[m over \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[m, and pure\u001b[?7h\u001b[110G\u001b[?7l\r\n\n\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mExternal Package Dependencies & Serialization\u001b[m: Should we lock the external dependency list in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jka01bedfc2eca0e22;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/pubspec.yaml\u0007pubspec.yaml\u001b[?7h\u001b[117G\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\n\n\n\n\u001b[93Dticated endpoint request\n\n\n\n\u001b[45D\u001b[?2026l"]
[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A1. \u001b[94mCatalogStore\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mCatalogPersistence\u001b[39;1m seam\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[94mCatalogStore\u001b[m (deep module) owns all domain rules: 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m uniqueness, duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cwarning lookup, stock clamping (\u001b[94m>= 0\u001b[m), container deletion cascading (\u001b[94mcontainerId: null, slot: null\u001b[m), and pre-\r\n\u001b[6Cimport validation.\u001b[K\n\u001b[18D• \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m (seam) exposes a minimal interface (\u001b[94mload()\u001b[m, \u001b[94msave(CatalogSnapshot)\u001b[m, \u001b[94mwritePreImportBackup()\u001b[m)\r\n\u001b[6Cwith two adapters: \u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m (atomic \u001b[94m.tmp\u001b[m write + rename and serialized write queue in iOS\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6CApplication Documents) and \u001b[94mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[m (for fast unit and widget tests).\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[39;1m seam\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Single-method interface \u001b[94mFuture<LcscLookupResult> lookupPart(String lcscCode)\u001b[m that hides the \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m URL\r\n\u001b[6Cconstruction, browser \u001b[94mUser-Agent\u001b[m header, \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m normaliza"]
[0.000, "o", "tion, HTML entity unescaping, and \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m → \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cmapping, backed by an injectable \u001b[94mhttp.Client\u001b[m (or fake adapter in tests).\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[39;1m (pure module, no adapter needed)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Stateless function/class taking \u001b[94m(parts, containers, SearchQuery)\u001b[m and returning ranked/grouped results—hiding\r\n\u001b[6CUnicode symbol folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m), SI/EE-infix engineering unit parsing (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m), 10-field\r\n\u001b[6Cmulti-token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m matching, 3-tier relevance ranking, and natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m sorting.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mRecommend yes\u001b[m: Use these exact three modules (\u001b[94mCatalogStore\u001b[m over \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[m, and pure\u001b[?7h\u001b[110G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m), avoiding shallow repository/use-case pass-through layers.\u001b[?7h\u001b[79G\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ3\u001b[m - \u001b[1mExternal Package Dep"]
