[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mOption A (Built-in Flutter \u001b[94;22mChangeNotifier\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mListenableBuilder\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: A single deep \u001b[94mCatalogStore extends ChangeNotifier\u001b[m\r\n  module holds the live \u001b[94mcontainers\u001b[m and \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m state, enforces domain invariants, and notifies listeners on\u001b[K\r\n  mutations—requiring zero third-party state management packages or code generation.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mOption B (\u001b[94;22mflutter_riverpod\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Manage state via Riverpod \u001b[94mNotifierProvider\u001b[m / \u001b[94mAsyncNotifierProvider\u001b[m.\n\u001b[89D\u001b[1mC (\u001b[94;22mflutter_bloc\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mprovider\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Use Bloc cubits or \u001b[94mpackage:provider\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mRecommend Option A (Built-in \u001b[94;22mChangeNotifier\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mListenableBuilder\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: It matches the single-screen architecture\u001b[?7h\u001b[113G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  prototyped in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke1597fed192947d7;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/04-workbench-ui-prototype.md"]
[0.000, "o", "\u0007Workbench UI flow and visual prototype\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007, keeps dependency overhead at zero, and concentrates all\u001b[?7h\u001b[112G\r\n  catalog mutations and domain invariants inside one cohesive module.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> riverpod\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 6s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\u001b[K  ❓ \u001b[1mQ2\u001b[m - \u001b[1mRiverpod Provider Style & Deep Module Seams\u001b[m: With \u001b[94mflutter_riverpod\u001b[m, how should we structure the providers\u001b[?7h\u001b[116G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  and module seams (\u001b[94mcodebase-design\u001b[m)?\u001b[?7h\u001b[38G\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mOption A (Hand-written Riverpod \u001b[94;22mAsyncNotifier\u001b[39;1m / \u001b[94;22mNotifier\u001b[39;1m + 3 Deep Modules, no \u001b[94;22mbuild_runner\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n      1. \u001b[94mCatalogNotifier extends AsyncNotifier<CatalogSnapshot>\u001b[m (backed by a \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m seam with\n\u001b[99D\u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m for iOS Documents atomic writes and \u001b[9"]
