[0.233, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  1. \u001b[1mCatalog Store & Persistence Seam (\u001b[94;22mlib/catalog/\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n      • \u001b[94m@freezed\u001b[m domain models: \u001b[94mPart\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCatalogSnapshot\u001b[m (\u001b[94mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[m, \u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcontainers\u001b[m, \u001b[94mparts\u001b[m).\r\n\t\u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m interface (\u001b[94mload()\u001b[m, \u001b[94msave(CatalogSnapshot)\u001b[m, \u001b[94mexportBackupFile(CatalogSnapshot)\u001b[m,\u001b[K\n\u001b[97D\u001b[94mreadImportFile(String path)\u001b[m) with two adapters behind \u001b[94mcatalogPersistenceProvider\u001b[m: \u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m (iOS\r\n\u001b[6CDocuments \u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m, serialized atomic \u001b[94m.tmp\u001b[m write + rename, pre-import \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m) and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[m (for unit/widget tests).\u001b[K\n\u001b[51D• \u001b[94m@riverpod class Catalog extends _$Catalog\u001b[m (\u001b[94mAsyncNotifier<CatalogSnapshot>\u001b[m): enforces all domain invariants\r\n\u001b[6C(strictly 1 Part per \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m, \u001b[94mquantity >= 0\u001b[m, duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m warning check, cascading container\r\n\u001b"]
[0.000, "o", "[6Cdeletion unassignment, and all-or-nothing snapshot import validation).\u001b[K\r\n  2. \u001b[1mLCSC Lookup Seam (\u001b[94;22mlib/lcsc/\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[m interface (\u001b[94mFuture<LcscPartMetadata> fetchPart(String lcscCode)\u001b[m) behind \u001b[94mlcscClientProvider\u001b[m, with\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mHttpLcscClient\u001b[m (querying \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com/ftps/wm/product/detail\u001b[m, browser \u001b[94mUser-Agent\u001b[m, HTML entity decoding, and\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m → \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m mapping) and fake adapters for tests.\u001b[K\r\n  3. \u001b[1mSearch & Engineering Unit Engine (\u001b[94;22mlib/search/\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • Pure stateless \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m module (Unicode folding \u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m/\u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m, SI & EE-infix canonical \u001b[94m(Dimension,\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mbaseValue)\u001b[m parser, 10-field multi-token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m matcher, 3-tier relevance ranking, and natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Csorting) wired into a derived \u001b[94m@riverpod\u001b[m \u001b[94mfilteredWorkbenchView\u001b[m provider.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mWorkbench UI (\u001b[94;22mlib/ui/\u001b[39"]
[0.000, "o", ";1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • The Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion workbench screen, Manage Containers sheet, and LCSC-first Add/Edit\r\n\u001b[6CPart sheet from \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8766d78daa230122;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/04-workbench-ui-prototype.md\u0007Workbench UI flow and visual prototype\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 converted to \u001b[94mConsumerWidget\u001b[m / \u001b[94mConsumerStatefulWidget\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[?7l\n\n\u001b[K  ➡️ \u001b[1mRecommend yes\u001b[m: Lock this 4-folder layout (\u001b[94mlib/catalog/\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlib/lcsc/\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlib/search/\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlib/ui/\u001b[m) and 3 module seams, and\u001b[?7h\u001b[118G\u001b[?7l\r\n\u001b[K  close \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk85b5cacfa8d735cf;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/07-flutter-state-management-and-architecture.md\u0007Flutter state management, package dependencies, and V1 spec lock\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[?7h\u001b[74G\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m──────────────────────────────────"]
