[0.000, "o", "), alongside \u001b[94mhttp\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpath_provider\u001b[m, \u001b[94mshare_plus\u001b[m, \u001b[94mfile_picker\u001b[m, \u001b[94murl_launcher\u001b[m, and \u001b[94muuid\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mDeep Module Seams (\u001b[94;22mlib/\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[94mlib/catalog/\u001b[m: \u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m notifier enforcing domain invariants over the \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m seam\n\u001b[93D(\u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m and \u001b[94mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[m).\u001b[K\n\u001b[56D• \u001b[94mlib/lcsc/\u001b[m: \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[m seam (\u001b[94mHttpLcscClient\u001b[m and test fakes).\n\u001b[55D\u001b[94msearch/\u001b[m: Pure \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m module for Unicode folding, SI/EE-infix engineering unit equivalence, 10-\r\n\u001b[6Cfield multi-token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m search, tiered ranking, and natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m sorting.\u001b[K\n\u001b[84D• \u001b[94mlib/ui/\u001b[m: Riverpod \u001b[94mConsumerWidget\u001b[m / \u001b[94mConsumerStatefulWidget\u001b[m workbench UI.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  Every decision ticket on the \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8e66eefc5b6f45d5;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/map.md\u0007Electronics "]
