[0.050, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[29A\u001b[33;1mCreate file\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1m/Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md\u001b[m  \u001b[32m+244\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  1 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m# Electronics Parts Tracker V1 Specification\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  2 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  3 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39mStatus: ready-for-agent\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Problem Statement\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39"]
[0.000, "o", "mAn electronics hobbyist or hardware engineer working at a physical workbench accumulates hundreds of distinct\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39melectronic components—surface-mount passives in sample binders, integrated circuits in drawer cabinets,\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mconnectors in compartment boxes, and newly arrived supplier bags from LCSC. Without a fast, offline-first\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mpersonal catalog on their phone, two friction points constantly interrupt workbench flow:\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m  9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m1. **Finding what is on hand and where it lives**: Answering questions like *\"Do I have a 4.7kΩ 0603 resistor\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mor a 100nF 50V X7R capacitor, how many are left, and which binder page or drawer slot is it in?\"* requires\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mdigging through physical "]
[0.000, "o", "bins or searching spreadsheets where \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"4k7\"`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"4.7kΩ\"`\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`\"4700R\"`\u001b[39m fail to match\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39meach other.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 10 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m2. **Tedious catalog entry and stock upkeep**: Entering new components manually from supplier bags requires\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mcopying Manufacturer Part Numbers (MPNs), packages, electrical ratings, and datasheet links by hand, while\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mmulti-screen inventory apps require too many taps just to deduct two capacitors used on a prototype board.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 11 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 12 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m## Solution\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 232 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Naviga"]
[0.000, "o", "te · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[42.032, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\n\u001b[J\u001b[31A\u001b[K\n  Rather than mocking internal modules against each other, tests exercise the full system through \u001b[1mone primary\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mapplication seam\u001b[m (\u001b[94mProviderContainer\u001b[m / \u001b[94mProviderScope\u001b[m) with overrides only at the two external I/O boundaries:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mPrimary Application Seam (\u001b[94;22mcatalogProvider\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mfilteredWorkbenchViewProvider\u001b[39;1m / Workbench UI via \u001b[94;22mProviderScope\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K • Tests drive the real \u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m notifier, real \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m (including SI/EE-infix unit equivalence, 10-\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K field multi-token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m search, tiered ranking, and natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m sorting), and real Workbench UI\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K widgets end-to-end.\u001b[K\n\u001b[20D\u001b[1K • Only external I/O is replaced via Riverpod provider overrides:\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K • \u001b[94mcatalogPersistenceProvider\u001b[m: Overridden with \u001b[94mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[m for fast domain/search/UI tests,\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K while \u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m"]
[0.000, "o", " itself is tested against a real temporary directory (\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K \u001b[94mcreateTemp\u001b[m) to verify atomic \u001b[94m.tmp\u001b[m write + rename, \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m creation, and \u001b[94mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K validation.\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K • \u001b[94mlcscClientProvider\u001b[m: Overridden with a fake adapter for UI/form auto-fill tests, while \u001b[94mHttpLcscClient\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K itself is tested using \u001b[94mpackage:http/testing.dart\u001b[m (\u001b[94mMockClient\u001b[m) against recorded \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m payloads to\u001b[K\r\n\t \u001b[1K verify \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m normalization, HTML stripping, and \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m → \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m mapping.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  Does this testing seam setup match your expectations for writing \u001b[94m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md\u001b[m?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for "]
[0.000, "o", "1m 42s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The specification document must be generated from the spec template, incorporating the \"ready...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(spec.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n⣽  \u001b[90mEdi\u001b[94mting \u001b[90mfiles...\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m>\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X"]
