[0.038, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[28A\u001b[K\r\n  Rather than mocking internal modules against each other, tests exercise the full system through \u001b[1mone primary\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[1mapplication seam\u001b[m (\u001b[94mProviderContainer\u001b[m / \u001b[94mProviderScope\u001b[m) with overrides only at the two external I/O boundaries:\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1mPrimary Application Seam (\u001b[94;22mcatalogProvider\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mfilteredWorkbenchViewProvider\u001b[39;1m / Workbench UI via \u001b[94;22mProviderScope\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n\u001b[6C• Tests drive the real \u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m notifier, real \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m (including SI/EE-infix unit equivalence, 10-\r\n\u001b[6Cfield multi-token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m search, tiered ranking, and natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m sorting), and real Workbench UI\r\n\u001b[6Cwidgets end-to-end.\n\u001b[19D• Only external I/O is replaced via Riverpod provider overrides:\r\n\t  • \u001b[94mcatalogPersistenceProvider\u001b[m: Overridden with \u001b[94mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[m for fast domain/search/UI tests,\r\n\t  while \u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m itself is tested against a real temporary direct"]
[0.001, "o", "ory (\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp.\u001b[m\r\n\t  \u001b[94mcreateTemp\u001b[m) to verify atomic \u001b[94m.tmp\u001b[m write + rename, \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m creation, and \u001b[94mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[m\r\n\t  validation.\r\n\t  • \u001b[94mlcscClientProvider\u001b[m: Overridden with a fake adapter for UI/form auto-fill tests, while \u001b[94mHttpLcscClient\u001b[m\r\n\t  itself is tested using \u001b[94mpackage:http/testing.dart\u001b[m (\u001b[94mMockClient\u001b[m) against recorded \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m payloads to\r\n\t  verify \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m normalization, HTML stripping, and \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m → \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m mapping.\r\n\n\n\n  Does this testing seam setup match your expectations for writing \u001b[94m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md\u001b[m?\r\n\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 42s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The specification document must be generated from the spec template, incorporating the \"ready.."]
