[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A1. \u001b[1mPrimary Application Seam (\u001b[94;22mcatalogProvider\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mfilteredWorkbenchViewProvider\u001b[39;1m / Workbench UI via \u001b[94;22mProviderScope\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m:\r\n      • Tests drive the real \u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m notifier, real \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m (including SI/EE-infix unit equivalence, 10-\r\n\u001b[6Cfield multi-token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m search, tiered ranking, and natural alphanumeric \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m sorting), and real Workbench UI\r\n\u001b[6Cwidgets end-to-end.\u001b[K\n\u001b[19D• Only external I/O is replaced via Riverpod provider overrides:\n\u001b[64D    • \u001b[94mcatalogPersistenceProvider\u001b[m: Overridden with \u001b[94mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[m for fast domain/search/UI tests,\r\n\t  while \u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[m itself is tested against a real temporary directory (\u001b[94mDirectory.systemTemp.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\t  \u001b[94mcreateTemp\u001b[m) to verify atomic \u001b[94m.tmp\u001b[m write + rename, \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m creation, and \u001b[94mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[m\r\n\t  validation.\u001b[K\r\n\t  • \u001b[94mlcscClientProvider\u001b[m: Overridden with a fake adap"]
[0.000, "o", "ter for UI/form auto-fill tests, while \u001b[94mHttpLcscClient\u001b[m\r\n\t  itself is tested using \u001b[94mpackage:http/testing.dart\u001b[m (\u001b[94mMockClient\u001b[m) against recorded \u001b[94mwmsc.lcsc.com\u001b[m payloads to\r\n\t  verify \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m normalization, HTML stripping, and \u001b[94mparamVOList\u001b[m → \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m mapping.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n\n  Does this testing seam setup match your expectations for writing \u001b[94m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md\u001b[m?\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> yes\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 42s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The specification document must be generated from the spec template, incorporating the \"ready...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(spec.md)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  The V1 specification has been written and published to \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk7fbdca66319ecdc0;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts"]
