[0.001, "o", "Parts Tracker V1 Map\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\u001b[K\n  • \u001b[1mProblem Statement & Solution\u001b[m: Offline-first iOS workbench catalog with Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion UI, 2-\r\n  level \u001b[94mContainer → Slot\u001b[m hierarchy, LCSC \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m auto-fill, SI/EE-infix engineering unit search equivalence, and\u001b[K\r\n  atomic on-device JSON persistence.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mUser Stories\u001b[m: 38 end-to-end user stories covering workbench browsing, inline stock adjustments, LCSC auto-fill,\r\n  custom \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m/\u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m management, 10-field multi-token search with unit normalization, and iOS Files\u001b[K\r\n  export/import.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mImplementation & Testing Decisions\u001b[m: \u001b[94m@freezed\u001b[m + \u001b[94mjson_serializable\u001b[m domain models, \u001b[94m@riverpod\u001b[m state management, the\r\n  three deep module seams (\u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m over \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m), JSON \u001b[94mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[m\r\n  contract, and high-seam integration/widget test strategy.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m──────"]
