[0.015, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A• \u001b[1mProblem Statement & Solution\u001b[m: Offline-first iOS workbench catalog with Dark Command Bar & Inline Accordion UI, 2-\r\n  level \u001b[94mContainer → Slot\u001b[m hierarchy, LCSC \u001b[94mCx\u001b[5b\u001b[m auto-fill, SI/EE-infix engineering unit search equivalence, and\u001b[K\r\n  atomic on-device JSON persistence.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mUser Stories\u001b[m: 38 end-to-end user stories covering workbench browsing, inline stock adjustments, LCSC auto-fill,\r\n  custom \u001b[94mSpecs\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m/\u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m management, 10-field multi-token search with unit normalization, and iOS Files\u001b[K\r\n  export/import.\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mImplementation & Testing Decisions\u001b[m: \u001b[94m@freezed\u001b[m + \u001b[94mjson_serializable\u001b[m domain models, \u001b[94m@riverpod\u001b[m state management, the\r\n  three deep module seams (\u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m over \u001b[94mCatalogPersistence\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLcscClient\u001b[m, and \u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m), JSON \u001b[94mschemaVersion: 1\u001b[m\r\n  contract, and high-seam integration/widget test strategy.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m──────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> /to-tickets\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 25s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  Here is the proposed breakdown of \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb38e6b77c99eb38e;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md\u0007spec.md\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 into \u001b[1m5 tracer-bullet vertical slices\u001b[m:\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mCore Part catalog tracer bullet (JSON persistence, Workbench accordion list, stock adjustments, and manual\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mAdd/Edit Part)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mBlocked by\u001b[m: None (can start immediately)\r\n\t\u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: End-to-end runnable app with \u001b[94m@freezed\u001b[m models (\u001b[94mPart\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mCatalogSnapshot\u001b[m), \u001b[94m@riverpod\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mCatalog\u001b[m state, atomic persistence to \u001b[94mparts_catalog.json\u001b[m (plus iOS \u001b[94mInfo.plist\u001b[m Files app sharing keys), and the\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6CDark Command Bar & Inline Accordion workbench UI. Users can brow"]
