[0.000, "o", "amped \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`parts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json`\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39msnapshot via the iOS Share Sheet, or trigger **Import Backup** to pick a \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`.json`\u001b[39m file from the iOS Files\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mpicker, validate its schema and referential integrity (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`schemaVersion == 1`\u001b[39m, valid required fields, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`quantity\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m>= 0`\u001b[39m, no duplicate **Container** or **Part** IDs, valid \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`Part.containerId`\u001b[39m references, and strict 1-to-1\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`(containerId, slot)`\u001b[39m uniqueness), review a confirmation dialog comparing current vs. incoming **Part** and\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m**Container** counts and \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`updatedAt`\u001b[39m timestamps, automatically write a pre-import safety copy\u001b[K\u001b[m\n\u001b[98D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;"]
[0.000, "o", "2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39m(\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`parts_catalog.backup.json`\u001b[39m), and replace the live catalog.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 4 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 5 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Blocked by:** 02: Physical storage hierarchy (Container management, 1-to-1 Slot uniqueness, and By Container\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[39mgrouped view)\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 6 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 7 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m**Status:** ready-for-agent\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 8 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  \u001b[90m 9 \u001b[39;48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m+  \u001b[39m- [ ] Triggering **Export Backup** from the command bar writes the current \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`CatalogSnapshot`\u001b[39m (\u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`schemaVersion:\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[4C\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m1`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`updatedAt`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`containers`\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`parts`\u001b[39m) as 2-space pretty-printed JSON to a t"]
[0.000, "o", "imestamped\u001b[K\u001b[m\n\u001b[92D\u001b[37m\u001b[1K \u001b[48;2;14;52;15m \u001b[32m   \u001b[38;2;151;198;123m`parts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json`\u001b[39m file and opens the iOS Share Sheet.\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m  … 6 more lines (f for full diff)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mAllow creation of this file?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, allow creation\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. No, deny creation\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mf\u001b[90;22m full diff\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[84X\u001b[84C\u001b[2mGemini 4 Argon · medium\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
[1.224, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\u001bM\u001b[J\u001b[30A\u001b[6C• \u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: End-to-end workbench search and facet filtering (\u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m). Searching runs multi-\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K token \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m matching across all 10 \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m fields (\u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m, \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m) with Unicode folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m), SI and EE-infix value equivalence (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m10\u001b[4bpF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m, without bare 3-digit EIA expansion), and 3-tier relevance ranking.\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K Users can filter via \u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, and dynamic category \u001b[94mChoiceChip\u001b[ms (intersecting via \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m with\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K search and hiding empty \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m in \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m mode when filtered).\u001b[K\r\n  5. \u001b[1miOS Share Sheet backup "]
[0.000, "o", "export and validated full-snapshot JSON import\u001b[m\u001b[K\n\u001b[69D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mBlocked by\u001b[m: Ticket 2\u001b[K\n\u001b[23D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: End-to-end backup and restore. Users can trigger \u001b[1mExport Backup\u001b[m to share a timestamped\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mparts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json\u001b[m file via the iOS Share Sheet (\u001b[94mshare_plus\u001b[m), or \u001b[1mImport Backup\u001b[m (\u001b[94mfile_picker\u001b[m) to\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K validate an incoming JSON snapshot (\u001b[94mschemaVersion == 1\u001b[m, required fields, \u001b[94mquantity >= 0\u001b[m, no duplicate IDs, valid\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mcontainerId\u001b[m references, and 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m uniqueness), confirm replacement against a summary of\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K current vs. incoming counts and \u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m timestamps, write \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m, and replace the live\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K catalog.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  Does this granularity and dependency graph (\u001b[94m1 → {2, 3}\u001b[m and \u001b[94m2 → {4, 5}\u001b[m) feel right, or should any tickets be merged\u001b[K\r\n  or split before I publish them?"]
