[0.000, "o", "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37;1mRequesting permission for:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m   mkdir -p .scratch/parts-tracker-v1/wayfinder && mv\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/01-lcsc-part-metadata-lookup.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/02-part-domain-model-and-specs.md\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/03-storage-location-hierarchy.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/04-workbench-ui-prototype.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/05-on-device-json-persistence-and-import-export.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/06-search-and-unit-normalization.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues/07-flutter-state-management-and-architecture.md\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/wayfinder/ && ls -la .scratch/parts-tracker-v1/issues\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[1mRun this command?\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, run command\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2"]
[0.000, "o", ". Yes, and always allow in this conversation for commands that start with 'mkdir'\r\n  3. Yes, and always allow for commands that start with 'mkdir' (Persist to settings.json)\r\n  4. No, cancel\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mctrl+g\u001b[90;22m edit/expand command\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[?2026l"]
[9.001, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[30A      • \u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: End-to-end workbench search and facet filtering (\u001b[94mPartSearchEngine\u001b[m). Searching runs multi-\r\n\u001b[6Ctoken \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m matching across all 10 \u001b[1mPart\u001b[m fields (\u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmpn\u001b[m, \u001b[94mmanufacturer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mcategory\u001b[m, \u001b[94mpackage\u001b[m, \u001b[94mContainer.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mname\u001b[m, \u001b[94mslot\u001b[m, \u001b[94mnotes\u001b[m, \u001b[94mspecs\u001b[m) with Unicode folding (\u001b[94mµ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mu\u001b[m, \u001b[94mΩ\u001b[m→\u001b[94mr\u001b[m), SI and EE-infix value equivalence (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m ↔\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94m4700R\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m10\u001b[4bpF\u001b[m, \u001b[94m3v3\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m3.3V\u001b[m, without bare 3-digit EIA expansion), and 3-tier relevance ranking.\r\n\u001b[6CUsers can filter via \u001b[94mAll\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, and dynamic category \u001b[94mChoiceChip\u001b[ms (intersecting via \u001b[94mAND\u001b[m with\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K search and hiding empty \u001b[1mContainers\u001b[m in \u001b[94mBy Container\u001b[m mode when filtered).\u001b[K\r\n  5. \u001b[1miOS Share Sheet backup export and va"]
[0.000, "o", "lidated full-snapshot JSON import\u001b[m\n\u001b[69D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mBlocked by\u001b[m: Ticket 2\u001b[K\n\u001b[23D\u001b[1K • \u001b[1mWhat it delivers\u001b[m: End-to-end backup and restore. Users can trigger \u001b[1mExport Backup\u001b[m to share a timestamped\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mparts-catalog-YYYY-MM-DD.json\u001b[m file via the iOS Share Sheet (\u001b[94mshare_plus\u001b[m), or \u001b[1mImport Backup\u001b[m (\u001b[94mfile_picker\u001b[m) to\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K validate an incoming JSON snapshot (\u001b[94mschemaVersion == 1\u001b[m, required fields, \u001b[94mquantity >= 0\u001b[m, no duplicate IDs, valid\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K \u001b[94mcontainerId\u001b[m references, and 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m uniqueness), confirm replacement against a summary of\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Ccurrent vs. incoming counts and \u001b[94mupdatedAt\u001b[m timestamps, write \u001b[94mparts_catalog.backup.json\u001b[m, and replace the live\r\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1K catalog.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  Does this granularity and dependency graph (\u001b[94m1 → {2, 3}\u001b[m and \u001b[94m2 → {4, 5}\u001b[m) feel right, or should any tickets be merged\r\n  or split before I publish them?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[90m────────"]
