[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[29A\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 14s\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  Here are the 5 tickets we will implement for the V1 Electronics Parts Tracker:\r\n\n  1. \u001b[1m01: Core Part catalog tracer bullet (JSON persistence, Workbench accordion list, stock adjustments, and manual\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mAdd/Edit Part)\u001b[m\r\n  2. \u001b[1m02: Physical storage hierarchy (Container management, 1-to-1 Slot uniqueness, and By Container grouped view)\u001b[m\r\n  3. \u001b[1m03: LCSC (Cx\u001b[5b) live metadata auto-fill and duplicate part warning\u001b[m\r\n  4. \u001b[1m04: Multi-token catalog search, filter chips, and SI / EE-infix engineering unit equivalence\u001b[m\r\n  5. \u001b[1m05: iOS Share Sheet backup export and validated full-snapshot JSON import\u001b[m\r\n\n  Before starting the TDD red → green cycles, here are the public interfaces and proposed testing seams from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk337513585b433c7c;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md#L217-L231\u0007spec.md:217-231\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\r\n\n  \u001b[1m### Public Interfaces & Proposed"]
