[0.083, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29A2. \u001b[1m02: Physical storage hierarchy (Container management, 1-to-1 Slot uniqueness, and By Container grouped view)\u001b[m\r\n  3. \u001b[1m03: LCSC (Cx\u001b[5b) live metadata auto-fill and duplicate part warning\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1m04: Multi-token catalog search, filter chips, and SI / EE-infix engineering unit equivalence\u001b[m\r\n  5. \u001b[1m05: iOS Share Sheet backup export and validated full-snapshot JSON import\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  Before starting the TDD red → green cycles, here are the public interfaces and proposed testing seams from\r\n  \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6b9b64ef38768732;file:///Users/brett/Demos/flutter-parts-experiment/parts_tracker_skilled/.scratch/parts-tracker-v1/spec.md#L217-L231\u0007spec.md:217-231\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Public Interfaces & Proposed Seams\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mSeam 1: Catalog & Search Integration via \u001b[94;22mProviderContainer\u001b[39;1m (\u001b[94;22mcatalogProvider\u001b[39;1m + \u001b[94;22mfilteredWorkbenchViewProvider\u001b[39;1m,\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mbacked by \u001b[94;22mInMemoryCatalogPersistence\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mPublic i"]
