[0.000, "o", "hat it catches / misses\u001b[m: Catches domain invariants (\u001b[94mquantity >= 0\u001b[m clamping, strict 1-to-1 \u001b[94m(Container, Slot)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cuniqueness, cascading container deletion unassignment, duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m detection, import validation) and\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cend-to-end 10-field search, Unicode folding, SI/EE-infix unit equivalence (\u001b[94m4k7\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m4.7kΩ\u001b[m, \u001b[94m0.1uF\u001b[m ↔ \u001b[94m100nF\u001b[m), 3-tier\r\n\u001b[6Cranking, and natural \u001b[94mSlot\u001b[m sorting; misses real filesystem I/O, HTTP wire parsing, and Flutter widget rendering.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mSeam 2: \u001b[94;22mFileCatalogPersistence\u001b[39;1m Adapter (\u001b[94;22mCatalogPersistence\u001b[39;1m over a temporary \u001b[94;22mDirectory\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mPublic interface\u001b[m: \u001b[94mFileCatalogPersistence.load()\u001b[m, \u001b[94msave(CatalogSnapshot)\u001b[m, \u001b[94msavePreImportBackup(CatalogSnapshot)\u001b[m,\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mwriteExportFile(CatalogSnapshot)\u001b[m.\u001b[K\n\u001b[33D• \u001b[1mWhat it catches / misses\u001b[m: Catches initial empty catalog creation, serialized atomic \u001b[94m.tmp\u001b[m write + rename to\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mpart"]
