[0.000, "o", "d not-found/network error handling; misses live LCSC\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[6Cavailability and UI form binding.\u001b[K\r\n  4. \u001b[1mSeam 4: Workbench Widget UI (\u001b[94;22mWidgetTester\u001b[39;1m pumping \u001b[94;22mPartsTrackerApp\u001b[39;1m with \u001b[94;22mProviderScope\u001b[39;1m overrides for\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[94mcatalogPersistenceProvider\u001b[39;1m and \u001b[94;22mlcscClientProvider\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n      • \u001b[1mPublic interface\u001b[m: Rendered Workbench screen, inline accordion cards, Command Bar search & filter chips (\u001b[94mBy\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6C\u001b[94mContainer\u001b[m, \u001b[94mLow Stock\u001b[m, \u001b[94mUnassigned\u001b[m, category chips), Part Detail sheet, Add/Edit Part sheet (including \u001b[1mFetch LCSC\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[6Cand duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m \u001b[1mJump to Part\u001b[m), Manage Containers sheet, and Backup/Import dialogs.\u001b[K\n\u001b[89D• \u001b[1mWhat it catches / misses\u001b[m: Catches user-observable widget rendering, tap/input interactions, inline stock\r\n\u001b[6Cadjustments, sheet navigation, and form validation feedback; misses native iOS Share Sheet / Files picker OS\r\n\u001b[6Cmodals.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\n  What do you think of this pub"]
