[0.099, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[0 q\u001b[29A    and duplicate \u001b[94mlcscCode\u001b[m \u001b[1mJump to Part\u001b[m), Manage Containers sheet, and Backup/Import dialogs.\u001b[K\r\n\t\u001b[1mWhat it catches / misses\u001b[m: Catches user-observable widget rendering, tap/input interactions, inline stock\r\n\u001b[6Cadjustments, sheet navigation, and form validation feedback; misses native iOS Share Sheet / Files picker OS\r\n\u001b[6Cmodals.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n  What do you think of this public interface and these 4 testing seams?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[33;1m?\u001b[m Should we lock these 4 testing seams for our TDD cycles?\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m> (Recommended) Confirm all 4 seams and proceed with vertical-slice TDD\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 38.4s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Edited the configuration file to enable file sharing and in-place document editing. Updated th...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 3 commands \u001b[37m(ls -la .. && ls -la ... · git init · flutter pub add flut...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(Info.plist)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(Info.plist)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m○\u001b[m \u001b"]
